<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lilovi la Bwina liyandikwi na Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lilovi la Bwina liyandikwi na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Lilovi la Bwina leliyandikwi na Luka ndi chitabu chimonga pagati ya vitabu mcheche vya Lilaganu la Mupya vyevidandaula ndava ya Yesu Kilisitu paatamili pamulima apa. Kila chimonga cha vitabu vyenivyo chikemelewa “Injili.” Mana yaki “Lilovi la Bwina.” Vitabu vyenivyo viyandikwi na Matei na Maluko na Luka na Yohani peamali kufwa Yesu. Luka ayandiki lepi luhumu lwa kutama kwa Yesu pamulima apa, nambu mewa ayandiki ndava ya matendu gevahengili vawuliwa vaki lukumbi Yesu amali kufwa na kuyuka. Muchitabu chechikemelewa Matendu ga vamitumi. Kawaka mundu mweimanya ndali chiyandikwi chitabu ichi cha Lilovi la Bwina, nambu vasomi vamahele visadika kuvya yihotoleka chayandikwi mu mwaka wa 70 peamali kuvevelekewa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwenuyu Luka mweayandiki chitabu ichi avi mlamisa, ndava ya njila yeahengili kuyandika na umanyi weahengili ulangisa kuvya avi mundu mweasomili. Luka aganili kuyandika uchakaka wa malovi ga kutama kwa Yesu pamulima apa idandaula mambu ngati chagahumalili muni vandu vangi vahotola kupewa utangatila pevisoma chitabu ichi Luka (musula 1:1-3). Luka avi lepi Myawudi Vakolosai (musula ya 4:10-14) Na ayandiki munjila yeyikuvakita vandu vangali Vayawudi. Lijambu lenili lilekana hotohoto peidandaula mivelu ya Vayawudi Luka (musula 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Lilovi la Bwina liyandikwi na Luka. Liwanangana neju na chitabu cha Matei na Maluko, ndava vidandaula mambu galagala munjila yeyiwanangana. Pagati ya vitabu vyenivi vidatu, chitabu cha Luka ndi chidandaula cha mugati ndava ya kuvelekewa kwa Yohani Mbatizaji. Luka ijovesa ndava ya kulekekesewa (musula ya 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34) Mewa na yemwali kuyupa (musula za 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io1">Luka itumbula kuyandika chitabu ichi kwa kujova akuvayandikila vayani (musula ya 1:1-4).</para>
  <para style="io1">Kangi idandaula ndava ya kuvelekewa kwa Yesu na cheajitendelekili mulihengu laki (musula ya 1:5-4:13).</para>
  <para style="io1">Pandu pavaha pasigalili muchitabu ichi Luka idandaula ndava lihengu leahengili Yesu, ndi neju gachinamtiti geajengili na mawuliwu geagawulili (musula ya 4:14-21:38).</para>
  <para style="io1">Musula zivili za pamwishu Luka idandaula Yesu cheafwili na kuvikiwa mu litinda na kuyuka kwaki (musula ya 22-24).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Mkulungu Teofili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Vandu vamahele valingi kuyandika bwina mambu gegahengiki pagati yitu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Vayandiki ngati chevatijovili vevagaweni penapo pegatumbukini magono ga mumbele mambu genago na kuvakokosela lilovi la Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Mewa na Mkulungu Teofili penamali kulolokesa uchakaka waki kwa magono gamahele, nilola mbanga nikuyandikila veve kwa uchakaka waki. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Nikiti chenichi muni nigana wamwene umanyayi mambu goha gevakuwulili.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvelekewa kwa Yohani Mbatizaji kukokoswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Lukumbi Helodi peavi Nkosi wa ku Yudea, ndi pavi na Mteta wa Chapanga mweikemiwa Zakalia wa chikundi cha uteta cha Abiya, na mdala waki avi Elizabeti wa lukolo lwa Aloni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Voha vavili vahenga ga kumganisa Chapanga na kuyidakila mihilu na malagizu ga Bambu changabuda. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Vavi lepi na mwana mbaka muugogolo wavi, ndava Elizabeti avi lepi na chiveleku.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Ligono limonga, Zakalia peavi mukuhenga lihengu laki la uteta mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Ngati cheyavili mivelu ya vamteta va Chapanga, Zakalia ahaguliwi kwa gudugudu kuyingila mu Nyumba ya Bambu ndava ya kuhukisa ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Na lukumbi lwa kuhukisa ubani palwahikili, vala voha vevakonganiki kumuyupa Chapanga vavi cha kuvala vayupayi.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Mtumu wa kunani kwa Bambu, akamuhumila na kuyima upandi wa kulyela wa lusanja lwa luteta lwa kuhukisa ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zakalia peamuweni mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga yula, akakenyemuka. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akamjovela, “Zakalia, kotoka kuyogopa muni Bambu ayuwini chawamuyupili, ndava mdala waku Elizabeti yati akubabila mwana mgosi na veve walamkemela Yohani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Ndi wamwene yati uheka pavaha na vandu vamahele valahekelela ndava ya kuvelekewa kwaki. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Mwenuyo yati ivya mkulu, pamihu ga Bambu, alanywa lepi divayi wala ugimbi, yati ilongoswa na Mpungu Msopi kuhumila mulileme la nyina waki. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Yati akuvawuyisa vandu vamahele wa pa Isilaeli, vamuwuyilayi Bambu Chapanga wavi. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Yati akumlongolela Bambu kuni ilongosiwa na makakala na Mpungu ngati Eliya. Ndava ya kuvatepulanisa vadadi na vana vavi, yati avakita vangamyidakila vavyayi na luhala ngati lwa vala vevakumyidikila, na kumtendelekela Bambu vandu vaki.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zakalia akamkota Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga, “Yati nimanya wuli ngati givya chenicho? Muni nene na mdala wangu tavagogolo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akayangula, “Nene na Gabulieli na mtumisi wa Chapanga. Ndi anitumili nijova na veve nikujovela lilovi la bwina lenili. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Yuwanila, yati wivya ngajova yati nakuhotola kujova, mbaka ligono lila pegihumila ago ndava ubeli kunisadika malovi gangu gene gihumila palukumbi lwaki.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Lukumbi lwenulo vandu vevamulindilayi Zakalia kuvala vakakangasa, muni atamakisi lukumbi lutali mu Nyumba ya Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Peahumili kuvala nakuhotola kujova na vayaki, vayaki vakamanya kuvya mu Nyumba ya Chapanga mula, muyavi agaweni maono ndi akayendelela kulangisa na mawoko muni avi ngajova.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Lukumbi lwaki lwa kuhenga lihengu la uteta palwamaliki, akawuya kunyumba yaki. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Lukumbi luhupi palwamaliki Elizabeti mdala wa Zakalia yula akavya na ndumbu, akawela munyumba miheyi mhanu, <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>kuni ajova “Bambu anitangatili na aniloli, hinu cheaniwusili soni pavandu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvelekewa kwa Yesu kujovekana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Mu mwehi wa sita, Chapanga amtumili mtumu waki wa kunani Gabulieli kumuji wa Nazaleti, ku Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Kwa kamwali mmonga mwavamkemela Maliya, Mwenuyo ahongiwi na mgosi mmonga liina laki Yosefu wa lukolo lwa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga Akamuhegelela akamjambusa, “Tikuwoni! Bambu avi pamonga na veve kangi akugubiki uganu waki!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Maliya peayuwini malovi gala, akakenyemuka, akahololela, jambusa yeniyi mana yaki kyani? <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akamjovela, “Kotoka kuyogopa Maliya, muni Chapanga aganisiwi na veve. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Walavya na ndumbu, walaveleka mwana mgosi, yati ukumkemela liina laki Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Mwenuyo yati ivya mkulu, yati ikemelewa Mwana wa Chapanga Mkulu. Bambu Chapanga yati amuvika kuvya Nkosi, ngati cheamuviki Nkosi Daudi mweavi gogo waki. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Ndi yati ivya Nkosi wa lukolo lwa Yakobo magono goha, na unkosi waki wangali na mwishu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Maliya akamyangula, “Genago galavya wuli, muni nene nangammanya mgosi?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akayangula, “Mpungu Msopi yati ukuhelelela, na uhotola waki Chapanga Mkulu walakugubika ngati chimuwili, muni mwana mweubwela kumveleka uyo, yati ikemelawa msopi na Mwana wa Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Hati mlongo waku Elizabeti, agegi ndumbu ya mwana mgosi na hinu mumwehi wa sita, pamonga na ugogolo waki, mweamanyikini na vandu kuvya ngaveleka. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Muni kawaka lilovi langahotoleka kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Maliya akajova, “Nene nivii penapa namvanda wa bambu, nikitiwayi ngati chaukajovili.” Ndi mtumi wa kunani kwa Chapanga akawuka.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maliya akumgendelela Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Ndi lwapiti lepi lukumbi lutali, Maliya akapanganyika akayumbatika kuhamba kumuji wewavi kuvidunda vya ku Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Kwenuko akayingila munyumba ya Zakalia akamjambusa Elizabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Bahapo Elizabeti peayuwini jambusa ya Maliya, kamwana kakahumba chaluheku mulileme la Elizabeti. Elizabeti akalongoswa Mpungu Msopi <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>akajova kwa lwami luvaha, “Umotisiwi kuliku vadala voha, na mweubwela kumveleka huyo amotisiwi! <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Nene nayani hati nyina wa Bambu wangu anibwelili? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Nikujovela, panayuwini jambusa yaku, kamwana kakahumba mulileme langu chaluheku. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Umotisiwi veve mweusadika kuvya yati gihumila gala geakujovili Bambu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maliya akumulumbalila Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Maliya akajova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Mtima wangu ukumlumba Bambu,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>mpungu wangu umhekela Bambu, ndava Msangula wangu.<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>Muni aulolili cha lipyana ungolongondi wa mvanda waki!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Kutumbula hinu viveleku vyoha yati vakunikemela mwenisangalwiki,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>ndava muni Chapanga ana makakala anihengili gakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">na liina laki ndi msopi<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Chivelekelu mbaka chivelekelu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">mwene magono goha avi na lipyana kwa vandu vevakumtopesa.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Alangisi makakala gaki kwa kukita mambu gakulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">Avapechengini vevimeka mumaholo ga mitima yavi.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Avahelisi vankosi vana makakala kuhumila muvigoda vya kulongosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">na avakwesi vevavi ngolongondi.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Vangangu avayukutisi mambu gabwina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">na vana vindu vyamahele avalekili vahamba mawoko gawaka.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Amtangatili mulima wa Isilaeli mtumi waki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">Akumbwiki lipyana laki,<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Ngati chaajovili kuvya na lipyana kwa Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">na chivelekelu chaki, magono goha.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Maliya akatama kwa Elizabeti ngati miyehi yidatu, ndi akawuya kunyumba yaki.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvelekewa kwa Yohani Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Palwahiki lukumbi lwa Elizabeti kuveleka ndi akavya na mwana mgosi. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Vandu va mu lukolo na veitamanila nawu papipi, pevayuwini Bambu amkitili lipyana neju, voha vakahekelela pamonga nayu.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Ligono la nane vakabwela kumdumula jandu mwana, vaganayi kumpela liina Zakalia, liina la dadi waki. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Nambu nyina waki akajova, “Lepi, mwenuyu ikemelewa Yohani.” <verse eid="LUK 1:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Vakamjovela, “Kawaka mu lukolo lwaki mweavi na liina ngati lenili!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Hinu vakamkota dadi waki chakumlangisa, muni vamanyayi aganili kumpela liina loki.<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Zakalia akayupa chibawu cha kuyandikila, akayandika, “Liina laki Yohani.” Vandu voha vakakangasa! <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Bahapo mlomo wa Zakalia akatumbula kulongela kangi akamulumba Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Vandu voha veatama nawu vakavya na wogohi, mambu ago gakalongaleka mulima woha wa vidunda vya ku Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Vandu voha vevayuwini mambu genago, vakaholalela mumitima yavi na kukotana vene kwa vene mumitima yavi, “Mwe mwana uyu yati ivya wuli?” Chakaka, makakala ga Bambu gavi pamonga na mwene.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulota wa Zakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Zakalia dadi mwana yula akalongoswa na Mpungu Msopi akatumbula kulotela ulota uwu.<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Ulumbiwa Bambu Chapanga wa Isilaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">Ndava ubweli kuvatangatila vandu vaki na kuvagombola.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Atipeli Msangula mkekesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">mu chiveleku cha Daudi mtumisi waki.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Ndi atijovili kadeni munjila ya vamlota vaki va msopi,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>Yati atisangula kuhuma mu mawoko ga makoko gitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">na mumakakala ga voha vavakutihakalila.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Ajovili yati avakitila lipyana vagogo vitu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">na akulihololela lilaganu laki la msopi.<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Chilapu alapili kwa dadi witu Ibulahimu, kuvya akutitangatila tete<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>tigomboka kuhuma mu mawoko ga makoko gitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">na timugundamila changali wogohi,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>muusopi na kukita gegakumganisa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">magono goha ga wumi witu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>“Wamwanangu veve, yati ukemelewa, mlota wa Chapanga mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">ndava walamlongolela Bambu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">kumkwalila njila yaki,<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>na kuvakokosela vandu kuvya valasanguliwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">kwa kulekekesewa kumbudila Chapanga wavi.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Chapanga witu yati ikita genago ndava lipyana ya mtima waki wa ngolongondi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">Usangula waki yati ubwela kuhuma kunani ngati lumuli chelulangasa chelihumila lilanga,<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>na kuvalangasila voha vevitama muchitita chikulu cha lifwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">na kutilongosa titama wumi wa uteke.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Mwana yula akakula, na akakangamala mumpungu waki. Akatama kulugangatu mbaka ligono paajilangisi pavandu va pa Isilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kuvelekewa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matei 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Lukumbi lwenulo, Agusiti mweavi nkosi mkulu wa vankosi va unkosi va ku Loma, alagizili vandu voha vayandikwa muchitabu. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Kuyandakiswa kwenuko kwakita kutumbukana, na lukumbi lwenulo Kulenio avi chilongosi wa ku Silia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Kila mundu, akahamba kumuji waki muni ajiyandikisayi.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Na Yosefu mewa akawuka pamuji wa Nazaleti wewavi kumulima wa Galilaya, akahamba kumuji wa Betelehemu wewavi pamulima wa ku Yudea, kweavelikiwi nkosi Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Akahamba kuyandakiswa pamonga na maliya mweavimchumba waki, mweavi na ndumbu. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Pevavi ku Betelehemu ligono laki likahika akavya na mwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Akaveleka mwana waki mtumbulanu mwana mgosi, akamtindisila tunyula twa vana, kangi akamgonesa muwatu wa kulisila mifuya, ndava vapati lepi fwasi munyumba za vayehe.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vamitumu va kunani na Vadimaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Pamulima wenuwo kwavi na vadimaji vevatama pandu pa kudimila na kulindalila mambelele gavi cha kupishana kilu.<figure style="fig" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" ref="2:8">Vadimaji vilindalila mambelele gavi</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Mtumu wa Chapanga akavahumila na lumuli lukulu lwa Bambu lwavalangasili, pandu poha. Vayogwipi neju. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Nambu Mtumu wa Chapanga akavajovela, “Mkotoka kuyogopa! Myuwanayi nivaletili lilovi la bwina la luheku neju kwa vandu voha va Paisilaeli. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Muni lelu pamuji wa Daudi avelikiwi msangula winu, Kilisitu ndi Bambu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Na ulangisu wa kummanya ndi uwu, yati mukumkolela mwana vamtindisili tunyula twa vana vamgonisi muwatu wa kulisila mifuya.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Bahapo msambi wa vamitumu vangi va kunani vakawungana na mtumi mwenuyo vakamulumba Chapanga na kujova,<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Alumbiwayi Chapanga kunani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">na uteke uvyaa pamulima kwa vandu veaganisiwi nawu!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Pavawuyili Vamitumu vala kunani, ndi vadimaji vakajovesana vene kwa vene, “Tihambayi ku Betelehemu tikagalola geatijovili Bambu aga.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Vakayumbatika kuhamba kwenuko, vakamkolela Maliya na Yosefu na vamgonisi mng'enya muwatu wa kulisila mifuya. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Vadimaji vala pavamuwene mwana yula, vakatumbula kujova goha gavayuwini kuhuma kwa Mtumu wa kunani kumvala mwana uyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Voha vavayuwini gevajoviwi na vadimaji vala, vakakangasa. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Ndi Maliya akagavika na kugahololela mambu goha mumtima waki. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Vadimaji vala vakawuya, kuni vakumulumbalila Chapanga kwa goha gavayuwini na kugalola, goha ngati chagajoviwi mtumi wa kunani.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana ipewa liina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Palapiti lijuma limonga, lukumbi lwa kumdumula mwana jandu lwaihiki, vakampela liina la Yesu, ndi liina la apewili na mtumu wa kunani kwakona nyina waki kuvya na ndumbu.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ipelekwa kunyumba ya Bambu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Payahikili ligono la Yosefu na Maliya kunyambiswa ngati chayaganikiwi na malagizu ga Chapanga geampelili Musa, ndi vampeliki mwana ku Yelusalemu ndava ya kumvika kwa Bambu. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Ngati chaiyandikiwi mu Malagizu ga Musa, “Kila mwana mgosi mwaatumbwili kuvelekewa yati ikemelewa msopi na kubaguliwa ndava ya lihengu la Bambu.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Ndi vakahamba kuwusa luteta kwa Chapanga, ngunda zivili amala mawela gavili, ngati chayaganikiwi mu Malagizu ga Bambu.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Lukumbi lwenulo ku Yelusalemu kula kwavi na mundu mmonga, liina laki Simioni, mwenuyo akitayi mambu ga kumganisa Chapanga na mwenuyo alindilayi kuhika lukumbi lwa vandu va Isilaeli kupumuliswa mitima. Na mpungu Msopi avi pamonga na mwene. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Mpungu Msopi amgubukuli Simoni yati ifwa lepi changamlola Kilisitu msangula mweahaguliwi yula mweajoviwi na Bambu. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Ndi Simoni alongwiswi na Mpungu msopi kuhamba mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, pamonga na dadi na nyina wa Yesu, pavampeliki mwana wavi Yesu ndava ya kukita ngati chayaganikiwi na mivelu ya malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa. <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simoni akampokela mwana Yesu mu mawoko gaki, kuni akumsengusa Chapanga, akajova.<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Hinu, Mkulu, ukitili ngati chewakajovili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">unilekayi, nene mvanda waku nihamba cha uteke.<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>Kwa mihu gangu niuwene usangula waku,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>Ndi uhuletili usangula palongolo ya vandu va milima yoha ulolekayi.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Lwenulo ndi lumuli lwa kuvamanyisa vandu vangali kuvya Vayawudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">na ukulu kwa vandu vaku va ku Isilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Dadi na nyina wa Yesu vakakangasa ndava ya malovi gala gegajoviki kumuvala mwana yula. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Ndi Simioni akavamotisa, akamjovela Maliya nyina waki Yesu, “Lola mwana uyu avelekiwi ndava ya vandu vamahele va Isilaeli kugwa kwa vandu vamahele na vangi vamahele kuyinuka, mwene yati ivya ulangisu wa kubelekana na vandu, <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>muni maholo ga vandu va mahele galalolekana pawaka. Wamwene lipyanda ngati upanga, ukuhomili mtima waku.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Kwavili na mdala mmonga mgogolo neju, mlota wa Chapanga, liina laki Ana, msikana wa Fanueli wa likabila la Asheli. Paavi msikana agegiwi na kutama na mgwana waki miyaka saba ndu. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Kangi asigalili lipwela mbaka muugogolo wa miyaka semanini na mcheche. Lukumbi lwoha awelai mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, ajihinisi kulya na kuyupa kilu na muhi. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Mdala yula akahumila lukumbi lulalula na kutumbula kumsengusa Chapanga na kuvajovela vandu voha gakumuvala mwana yula, vevalindila kugombolewa na kulekekesewa kwa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Yosefu na Maliya pavamali kukita goha gegalagiziwi mu Malagizu ga Bambu, vawuyili kumuji wavi Nazaleti wewavi ku Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Mwana yula akakula na kuvya na makakala, akamema luhala na umotisi wa Chapanga wavi pamonga na mwene.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Msongolo Yesu mu Nyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Kila mwaka dadi na nyina waki Yesu vahambili ku Yelusalemu kumselebuko wa Vayawudi wewikemiwa pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Yesu peahikisi miaka kumi na yivili, voha vakakwela kuhamba ku Yelusalemu, kumselebuko wa vayawudi wa pasaka ngati chayavi mivelu yavi. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Mselebuko pawamaliki, vakawuya, Yesu asigalili ku Yelusalemu changali dadi na nyina waki kumanya. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Dadi na nyina vaki vaholalili avi pamonga mulugendu, vakagenda muhi woha, kangi vakatumbula kumulonda kwa valongo vaki na vankozi waki. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Vamuweni lepi, vakawuya ku Yelusalemu vakumulonda. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Ligono la datu la kumlonda, vakamkolela mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, atamii pagati ya vawula va malagizu, akuvayuwanila na kuvakota. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Voha vevamuyuwanila malovi gaki vakavya kumkangasa ndava ya luhala na kuyangula kwaki. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Na pavamuweni vakakenyemuka, nyina waki akamkota “Wamwana vangu ndava kyani utikitili genaga? Dadi waku na nene ting'ahiki neju kukulonda.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Yesu akayangula, “Ndava kyani mukunilonda? Mumanyi lepi ngati yikunigana nene kuvya munyumba ya Dadi wangu?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Nambu dadi na nyina waki nakugamanya malovi gala geavajovili.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Yesu akawuya pamonga nawu ku Nazaleti, akuvayuwanila. Nyina waki akayendelela kugaholalela mambu goha mumtima waki. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yesu akayonjokeseka kukula luhala na higa, akaganisiwa neju na Chapanga na vandu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kukokosa kwa Yohani Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matei 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohani 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Wavi mwaka wa kumi na mhanu wa unkosi waki nkosi wa ku Loma Tibelio, penapo Ponsio Pilatu avi nkosi wa mulima wa ku Yudea. Na Helodi alongosai ku Galilaya, na mhaja waki Filipi alongosa ku Itulea na Tilakoniti. Na Lusania alongosa ku Abilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>lukumbi lwenulo Anasi na Kayafa vavi vamlota vakulu va Chapanga. Penapo ndi lilovi la Chapanga lamhikili Yohani mwana wa Zakalia kulugangatu. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Yohani akahamba pamulima woha wewavi mumbaka wa mfuleni Yoludani, akavya kuvakokosela vandu, valekayi kumbudila Chapanga na vabatiziwa, na Chapanga yati akuvalekekesa gevambudili.<verse eid="LUK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Ngati chegayandikwi muchitabu cha Isaya mweavi mlota wa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Mundu ikemela kwa lwami luvaha kulugangatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Mumkwalila Bambu njila yivaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">mukagolosa pala peibwela kupita.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Ligodi loloha lihilaliwayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Chitumbi chochoa na chitumbi yati chidandasiwayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">na pepapindili yati pigoloswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">na njila zina magodi zihilaliwayi.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Na vandu voha va pamulima yati vaulola usangula kuhuma kwa Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Yohani akaujovela msambi wa vandu vevamuhambili ndava ya kubatiziwa. “Nyenye vana va Liyoka! Yani mweavajovili ngati muhotola kutila ligoga la Chapanga yeyivii papipi kubwela? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Ngati mikongo ya matunda cheyiganikiwa kupambika, na nyenye mkitayi mambu ga kulangisa, mkotwiki kumbudila Chapanga. Mkotoka kutumbula kujijovela ngati Ibulahimu dadi witu. Chakaka nikuvajovela Chapanga ihotola kugakita maganga aga kuvya vana va Ibulahimu! <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Na hinu livagu livi litendekiwi pamikiga ya mkongo, na mkongo wowoha wula wangapambika matunda gabwina yati udumuliwa na kutagiwa kumotu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Msambi wa vandu ukamkota Yesu, “Hinu tikita kyani?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Yohani akavayangula, “Mundu mweavi na nyula zivili ampela muyaki mweangavya nazu, na mweavi na vyakulya na mwene akita mewa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Na vatola kodi mewa vabwelili kwa Yohani kubatiziwa, ndi vakamkota “Muwula, hinu tikita wuli tete?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>“Akavajovela, mkotoka kutola kodi kuyonjokesa chemulagaziwi.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Manjolinjoli na vene vakamkota, “Na tete tikita wuli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Akavajovela, “Mkotoka kutola mashonga kwa mundu yoyoha kwa makakala na kumtakila mundu yoyoha ga udese na mukolayi na luhuna zinu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Ndava vandu voha valindalilayi kubwela kwa msangula, ndi vakatumbula kukotana vene kwa vene kumvala Yohani, manya mwene ndi Kilisitu msangula mwaatijovili Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Yohani akavajovela woha, “Nene nikuvabatiza kwa manji, nambu mweibwela ana makakala kuliku nene, kwa mwene, nene chindu lepi nakuganikiwa hati kuwopola nyosi za champali zaki. Mwene yati akuvabatiza kwa Mpungu Msopi na motu. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Mu mawoko gaki akamwili lupalu lwa kupepetela nganu, na nganu ya bwina akuyivika pamonga muchibana, na masasa akugayocha motu wangajima.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Na kwa malovi gangi gamahele, Yohani akangamili kuvajovela vandu vakotoka kumbudila Chapanga kwa kuvakokosela Lilovi la Bwina. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Nambu Yohani amuywangili chilongosi Helodi, ndava amtoli Helodiya mdala wa mhaja waki na kumgega, na mambu gahakau gamahele geakitili. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Kangi Helodi akayonjokesa uhakau, kwa kumkunga Yohani muchifungu.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ibatiziwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matei 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maluko 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Vandu voha pavamali kubatiziwa, Yesu namwene abatiziwi na kuni iyendelela kuyupa kwa Chapanga, lihundi la kunani likadinduka. <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>Ndi Mpungu Msopi ukamuhelela panani yaki wavi ngati higa ya ngunda, na lwami lukayuwanika kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga, “Veve ndi wamwana vangu mweuniganisi.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vagogo va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matei 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yesu peatumbwili kuhenga lihengu lila, ahegalili miyaka selasini. Na vandu vangi vamuholalelayi manya avi mwana wa Yosefu, Yosefu avi mwana wa Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Heli avi mwana wa Matati, Matati avi mwana wa Lawi, Lawi avi mwana wa meliki, Meliki avi mwana wa Yanai, Yanai avi mwana wa Yosefu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>mweavi mwana wa matatia, mwana wa Amosi, mwana wa Nahumu, mwana wa Esili, mwana wa Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>mwana wa Maati, mwana wa Matatia, mwana wa Shemeni, mwana wa Yoseki, mwana wa Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>mweavi mwana wa Yohanani, mwana wa Lesa, mwana wa Zelubabeli, mwana wa Shealitieli, mwana wa Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>mwana wa Meliki, mwana wa Adi, mwana wa Kosamu, mwana wa Elimadamu, mwana wa Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>mweavi mwana wa Yoshua, mwana wa Eliezeli, mwana wa Yolimu, mwana wa Matati, mwana wa Lawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>mweavi mwana wa Simioni, mwana wa Yuda, mwana wa Yosefu, mwana wa Yonamu, mwana wa Eliakimu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>mweavi mwana wa Melea, mwana wa Mena, mwana wa Matata, mwana wa Nasani, mwana wa Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>mweavi mwana wa Yese, mwana wa Obedi, mwana wa Boazi, mwana wa Solomoni, mwana wa Nashoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>mweavi mwana wa Aminadabu, mwana wa Adimini, mwana wa Alini, mwana wa Heziloni, mwana wa Pelisi, mwana wa Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>mweavi mwana wa Yakobo, mwana wa Izaki, mwana wa Ibulahimu, mwana wa Tela, mwana wa Naholi, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>mweavi mwana wa Selugi, mwana wa Leu, mwana wa Pelegi, mwana wa Ebeli, mwana wa Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>mweavi mwana wa Kenani, mwana wa Alifakisadi, mwana wa Shemu, mwana wa Nuhu, mwana wa Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>mweavi mwana wa Metusela, mwana wa Henoki, mwana wa Yeledi, mwana wa Mahalaleli, mwana wa Kenani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>mweavi mwana wa Enoshi, mwana wa Seti, mwana wa Adamu mwavi mwana wa Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kulingiwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matei 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maluko 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yesu akahuma ku Yoludani, kuni amemiswi Mpungu Msopi na kalongoswa nayu kuhamba kulugangatu. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Kwenuko Setani amlingili kwa magono alobaini. Magono genago goha atamili changalya chindu, pamwishu njala yikamuvina.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Setani akamjovela, “Ngati veve Mwana wa Chapanga, lijovela liganga lenili livya libumunda.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Yesu akamyangula, “Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova, wumi wa mundu uvi lepi ndava ya kulya libumunda lene.”<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Kangi mzuka mkulu akamtola mbaka panani neju, kugubika na kugubukula mihu, ndi akamlangisa unkosi woha weuvili pamulima poha. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Penapo Setani akamjovela, “Yati nikupela kutalalila vindu vyoha ivi na ukulu waki woha. Muni nipewili vindu ivi vyoha, na nene ngati nigana yati nikumpela mundu yoyoha nihotola kumpela. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Yati nikupela ivi vyoha, ngati unifugamila.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yesu akamyangula, “Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova. ‘Yati ukumfugamila Bambu Chapanga na kumhengela mwene ndu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Kangi Mzuka mkulu akamtola mbaka ku Yelusalemu na kuyima panani pa chituvilu cha Nyumba ya Chapanga, akamjovela, “Ngati veve wamwana wa Chapanga, jitagayi pahi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Muni Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova, ‘Chapanga yati akulagazila vamitumu va kunani vakuyangalila.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>‘Kangi yati vakuyanga mu mawoko gavi, ukotoka kujikuvala chigendelu chaku muliganga.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Nambu Yesu akamyangula, “Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova, ‘Kotoka kumulinga Bambu Chapanga waku.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Setani mkulu peamali kumlinga Yesu kwa njila zoha, akamuleka kwa lukumbi.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu itumbula lihengu laki ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matei 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maluko 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Kwa kulongoswa na Mpungu msopi Yesu akahamba ku Galilaya. Na ujumbi waki ukadandasika ku Galilaya na mumilima yoha ya papipi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Yesu avili mukuwula vandu munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi na kulumbiwa na vandu voha.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumbelalela ku Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matei 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maluko 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Yesu akahamba ku Nazaleti, pandu pealeliwi. Palahiki Ligono la Kupumulila, akayingila munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi, ngati chayavili mvelu waki, akayima muni asomayi Mayandiku Gamsopi. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Apewili chitabu cheayandiki Isaya mweavi mlota wa Chapanga, ndi akachitalambula na kulonda ndi apawene pandu pepayandikiwi.<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>“Mpungu wa Bambu uvi pamonga na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">anihagwili nene ndava ya kuvakokosela vangangu Lilovi la Bwina.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Anitumili nivakokosela vavanda kulekekeswa kwavi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">na vangalola vahotola kulola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">anitumili nivasangulayi woha veving'ahiswa,<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>kukokosa mwaka wa Bambu yati ilangisa ubwina kwa vandu vaki.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Kangi, akachigubika chitabu akamuwuyisila mtumisi na kutama pahi. Vandu voha vevavi munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi, vakamuhutusila mihu. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Mwene akavajovela, “Lelu Mayandiku aga Gamsopi gahikili pemwaniyuwani penakasomili.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Vandu voha vakaganiswa nayu na kukangasa ndava ya Malovi gabwina geajovili. Vakakotana, “Wu, mwenuyu mwana wa Yosefu lepi?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Yesu akavajovela, “Nimanyili mukunijovela luhumu ulu, ‘Mlamisa, jilamisa wamwene. Goha getayuwini’ Gawakitili Kapelanaumu gala, Ugakitayi goha penapa pachijiji chaku. <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Akayendelela kuvajovela,” “Chakaka nikuvajovela, kawaka Mlota wa Chapanga, mweiyidakiliwa pachijiji chaki.”<verse eid="LUK 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>“Muyuwanila, chakaka nikuvajovela, vavi valipwela vamehele pamulima wa Isilaeli lukumbi lwa Eliya, lukumbi lwenulo yatonyi lepi fula kwa miyaka yidatu na miyehi sita, na kwavi na njala yivaha pamulima woha. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Nambu Eliya atumiwi lepi kuhamba kwa lipwela yoyoha yula, ndi kwa lipwela mmonga mwaatamayi kumuji wa ku Selefati kumulima wa Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Na mulukumbi lwa Elisha mweavi Mlota wa Chapanga, kwavi na vandu vamahele pamulima wa Isilaeli vevavi na mabudi, kawaka mundu mweanyambiswi, nga Naamani mwene, mundu wa ku Silia.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Vandu voha vevavi munyumba ya kukonganekela vayawudi, pevayuwini genago, vayomili neju. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Vakayima, vakamuhumisa kuvala ya muji na kumtola mbaka panani pamkingisa wa chitumbi. Ndava muji wavi wajengiwi pachitumbi, Muni vagana kumkang'ila pahi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Nambu Yesu akaholota pagati yavi, akahamba.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu mweavi na mzuka uhakau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maluko 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Kangi Yesu akahelela kumuji wa ku Kapelanaumu, mulima wa Galilaya, na Ligono la Kupumulila avawulayi vandu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Vakakangasa na mawuliwu gaki, muni ujumbi waki wavi na uhotola. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Hinu munyumba ya kukonganela Vayawudi mula, kwavi na mundu mweavi na mzuka uhakau, akavemba kwa lwami luvaha, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“Mwe! Yesu wa ku Nazaleti Una kyani na tete? Wu, ubweli kutikomakesa? Nene nikumanyili wayani veve, veve wa Msopi wa Chapanga!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yesu akauhakalila mzuka wula akajova, “Guna! Muwuka mundu uyu!” Ndi mzuka wula ukamugwisa pahi palongolo ya vandu, ukamuhuma changalemasa.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Vandu voha vakavya kukangasa, vakajovesana, “Lenili liwulo la chinamtiti, Mundu uyu anauhotola na makakala ya kuvinga mizuka na yene yiwuka!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Na mambu ga Yesu gakadandasika pandu poha penapo.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalamisa vandu vamahele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matei 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maluko 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Yesu peahumili munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi mula, akahamba kunyumba ya Simoni. Kwenuko mau mmonga mweavi mkohanu waki Simoni, avi na utamu neju, vakamjovela Yesu amulamisa. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Yesu, akahamba, akamgundamila mau yula, akauhakalila utamu ula, balapala mau yula akalama, akayimuka na akatumbula kuvatelekela.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Palatipimi lilanga, mundu yeyoha mweavili na mtamu, wa utamu wowoa wula, ampeliki kwa Yesu, na mwene akampamisa mawoko kila mtamu, na kuvalamisa woha.<verse eid="LUK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Mizuka na yene, yavahumili vandu vamahele, yikaywanga cha kujova, “Veve Mwana waki Chapanga!” Nambu Yesu akayibesa mizuka kujova, muni gammanyili mwene ndi Kilisitu msangula mweahaguliwi na Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ikokosa ku Yudea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Maluko 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Chilau yaki lukela Yesu akawuka akahamba pandu pachiepela. Vandu vakavya kumulonda, pavamuweni valingili kumbesa akotoka kuwuka. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Nambu mwene akavajovela, “Niganikiwi kukokosa na kumiji yingi mewa Lilovi la Bwina la Unkosi wa Chapanga. Ndava muni chenichi ndi Chapanga chaanitumili nihengayi.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Ndi akayendelela kukokosa vandu Lilovi la Bwina munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi pamulima wa ku Yudea.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakemela vawuliwa va kutumbula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matei 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maluko 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Ligono limonga, Yesu peayimili mumihana ya nyanja ya ku Genezaleti, msambi wa vandu vamhinyayi kumtindila, muni vayuwanila lilovi la Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Ndi aziweni watu zivili mumuhana ya nyanja, zavazilekili valova somba, muni vene vasanja ngwanda zavi. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Yesu akayingila muwatu wa mundu mmonga mwavamkemela Simoni, akamjovela Simoni wusayi watu pamuhana hegelesa mumanji palongolo padebe kuhuma pandumba. Yesu akatama muwatu na kutumbula kuwula msambi wa vandu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Peamali kuwula, akamjovela Simoni, “Hegelesa watu waku mbaka pamanji gamahele, mukahelesa ngwanda zinu mlova somba.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simoni akamyangula, “Bambu, tikangamili kulova somba kilu yoha kawaka chindu chetipati, nambu ndava ujovi veve yati tihamba kuhelesa ngwanda mumanji.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Ndi pavahelisi ngwanda zavi, vakapata somba zamahele mbaka ngwanda zikatumbula kudauka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Vakavakemelela na vayavi vevavi muwatu wungi, vabwelayi kuvatangatila. Vakabwela, vakamemesa watu zoha zivili somba mbaka zikatumbula kudodomela. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simoni Petili pealoli genago, akamfugamila Yesu akajova, “Bambu uwuka palongolo yangu, ndava nene mwenimbudila Chapanga!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Ndava vapatili somba zamahele. Simoni pamonga na vayaki voha vakakangasa, <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Mewawa Yakobo na Yohani vana va Zebedayo vevavili valova somba vayavi, pamonga na Simoni na vene vakakangasa. Yesu akamjovela Simoni, “Kotoka kuyogopa, kutumbula hinu wivya lepi mlova somba nambu yati wivya mlova wa vandu ndi kuvaleta vandu kwa Bambu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Ndi, pavamali kuzivika watu zila mumhana ya nyanja, vakagaleka goha na kumlanda Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amunyambisa mtamu wa mabudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matei 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maluko 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Ndi Yesu paavi kumuji umonga wa kwenuko, mgosi mmonga anamabudi higa yoha pamuweni Yesu, akamgwilila chakukupama mumagendelu gaki na akamjovela, “Bambu, ngati wigana uhotola kuninyambisa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yesu akatalambula chiwoko chaki na kumpamisa akamjovela, “Nigana unyambasikayi!” Bahapo akalama mabudi gala. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Yesu akambesa, “Ukoto kumjovela mundu yeyoha, ndi uhamba ukajilangisa kwa Mteta wa Chapanga, ukawusa luteta ngati cheyilagiza mumhilu ya Chapanga geampeli Musa, muni yimanyikana kwa vene kulangisa kuvya unyambisiwi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Nambu Lilovi la Yesu likayendelea kudandasika pandu poha, na misambi ya vandu vakakonganeka muni vamyuwanila na kulamiswa matamu gavi. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Nambu mwene akajibagula kuchiyepela, akavya mukuyupa kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mundu mweapoli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matei 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maluko 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Ligono limonga, Yesu peavili mukuwula. Vafalisayu na vawula va malagizu ga Musa kuhuma mukila chijiji cha ku Galilaya na Yudea na Yelusalemu vakavya kutama penapo. Na makakala ga Bambu wavi pamonga nayu, wa kulamisa vatamu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Ndi lukumbi lulalula, vakabwela vandu vevamugegesini mundu mgosi palusongwani, mwepolili higa agonili lusongwani, vakalinga kumyingisa mugati, vamuvikayi palongolo ya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Nambu nakuhotola kuyingila nayu mugati ndava ya vandu vamahele. Ndi vakakwela panani ya nyumba vakabowola chipagalu, na vakamuhelesa mweapoli yula pamonga na lusongwani lwaki mbaka peavili Yesu.<figure style="fig" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" ref="5:19">Vandu mcheche vakumuhelesa mutamu mulusongwani</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Yesu peayiweni kusadika kwavi kula, akamjovela mwaalwala yula, “Nkozi wangu, ulekekiswi kumbudila Chapanga waku.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Vafalisayu na vawula va malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa vakatumbula kukotana, “Mwenuyu mundu kiki mweakumliga Chapanga? Kawaka mundu mweihotola kulekekesa kubuda ndi nga Chapanga mwene!”<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Nambu Yesu amanyili maholo gavi akavakota, “Ndava kyani mukujikota genago mumitima yinu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Chinonopa kiki, kujova ‘ulekekiswi kumbudila Chapanga waku,’ Amala kujova ‘Yima ugendayi’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Hinu, nigana mumanyayi, Mwana wa Mundu ana uhotola wa kuvalekekesa vandu pamulima vevakumbudila Chapanga.” Ndi akamjovela mwaalwala yula, “Yima, tola lusongwani lwaku, uhamba kunyumba!”<verse eid="LUK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Bahapo, mundu mweapoli yula akayima akatola, lusongwani lwaki lweagonili na akawuya kunyumba yaki kuni amulumbalila Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Vandu voha vakakangasa na kuvya na wogohi, kuni vamulumbalilayi Chapanga vakajova, “Tigaweni mambu ga kukangasa lelu!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumkemela Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matei 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maluko 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Kangi, Yesu akahuma kuvala ndi amuwene mtola kodi mwavamkemela Lawi atamili munyumba ya kutolela kodi. Yesu akamjovela, “Nilandayi!” <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Lawi akayima na kuleka kila chindu, akamlanda.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Kangi, Lawi amgongolili Yesu kunyumba yaki, na msambi wa vatola kodi na vandu vangi vatamili kulya pamonga na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Vafalisayu na vawula va Malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa vakavang'ung'utila vawuliwa vaki vakajova, “Ndava kyani mwilya na vatola kodi na vandu vevakumbudila Chapanga?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yesu akavayangula, “Vangalwala vigana lepi mlamisa, nambu vevilwala vigana mlamisa. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Nene nibweli lepi kuvakemela vandu vevikita gegakumganisa Chapanga, nibweli kuvakemela vandu vevakumbudila Chapanga vamuwuyila.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lijambu la kujihinisa chakulya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matei 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maluko 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Vandu vangi vakamjovela Yesu, “Vawuliwa va Yohani vakujihinisa chakulya na kuyupa, na vawuliwa va Vafalisayu na vene vikita mewa. Nambu vawuliwa vaku vilya na vinywa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yesu akavayangula, “Wu, muhololela kuvya muhotola kuvakita vankozi va mkolo ndowa vajihinisa chakulya kuni vavi pamonga na mkolo ndowa? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Nambu lwalabwela lukumbi lwa Bambu kuwusiwa kuhuma kwavi, ndi penapo yati vakujihinisa kulya.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Kangi Yesu akavajovela luhumu ulu, “Kawaka mundu mweipapula chilaka munyula ya mupya na kutota mulindimula. Ngati akitili chenichi, yati ayihalabisi nyula yeniyo na chilaka chenicho yati chiwanangana lepi na lindimula lila.” <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Kavili kawaka mundu mweisopa divayi ya mupya mulindimula la lihaku lelitengenizwi kwa chikumba, akakita chenicho, mahaku ga chikumba gala gipapuka na divayi yiyitika na mahaku ga chikumba yati gipapuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Nambu divayi ya mupya yisopewa mumahaku ga chikumba cha mupya. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Kawaka mundu mweinogela kunywa divayi ya mupya ngati akalongolili kunywa divayi ya kadeni. Muni ijova ya kadeni yila yabwina neju.<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Likotesi ndava ya Ligono la Kupumulila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matei 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maluko 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Ligono la Kupumulila, Yesu apitayi mumigunda ya nganu. Vawuliwa vaki vakatumbula kudenya njechela za nganu, vakagayogola mumawoko gavi vakalya ngele zaki. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Nambu Vafalisayu vangi vakavakota, “Ndava kyani nyenye mukita chindu chechibesiwi Ligono la Kupumulila?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yesu akavayangula, “Wu! Mwangasoma cheakitili Daudi na vayaki pevavi na njala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Ayingili mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, akatola mabumunda gegavikiwi pandu pa Chapanga, akalya na akavagavila na vayaki. Mabumunda genago gavi ndava ya vamlota va Chapanga ndu, ndi vevalyayi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Kangi akavajovela, “Mwana wa Mundu ndi Bambu wa Ligono la Kupumulila.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mundu mweagogodili chiwoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matei 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maluko 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Ligono lingi la Kupumulila, Yesu akahamba munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi kuwula. Kumbi mugati mula avili mundu mmonga mwaapopotwiki chiwoko chaki cha kulyelela. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Vawula va malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa na Vafalisayu vamlolokisi takataka Yesu, valola ngati akumlamisa mundu Ligono la Kupumulila muni valonda lilovi la kumtakila. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Nambu Yesu agamanyili goha gavaholalela na akamjovela mweagogodili chiwoko yula, “Yimuka, uyima palongolo yavi.” Mundu yula akayima akahamba penapo. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Yesu akavajovela, “Nikuvakota nyenye, malagizu gitu gijova wuli kuyivala Ligono la Kupumulila? Wu, tihotola kukita lijambu labwina amala tihotola kukita lijambu lihakau? Wu, tihotola kusangula wumi wa mundu amala tihotola kukoma?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Akavalolokesa vandu voha vevavili penapo, akamjovela mwaapopotwiki chiwoko yula, “Golosa chiwoko chaku.” Mundu yula akagolosa, na akalama chiwoko chaki.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Nambu vene vakayoma neju, vakajovesana, vamkitila kyani Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ihagula Vamitumi Kumi na Vavili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matei 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maluko 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Lukumbi luhupu palongolo, Yesu akahamba kuchitumbi kuyupa kwa Chapanga, akatama mihu kilu yoha kumuyupa Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Chilau yaki lukela, akavakemela vawuliwa vaki, ndi akavahagula vandu kumi na vavili ndi akavakemela vamitumi. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Simoni mewa mwapewili liina lingi na Yesu la Petili, na mbena waki Andelea mlongo waki na Yakobo na Yohani na Filipi na Batolomei, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Na Matei na Tomasi na Yakobo mwana wa Alufayo na Simoni mweakemeliwi Zelote, ndava avili mundu wa kukengelela mulima waki, <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Na Yuda mwana wa Yakobo na Yuda Isikalioti mweabweli kumung'anamukila Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awulayi na kuvalamisa vandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matei 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Yesu paahelili kuchitumbi pamonga nawu, akayima pamtambu, penapo pavi na vawuliwa vaki na msambi wa vandu vamahele vakuhuma ku Yudea yoha, na ku Yelusalemu na pamulima wa kumbwani ya ku Tilo na ku Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Vandu voha vabweli kumyuwanila Yesu na vevavi na utamu vagana valamisiwayi. Mewa ayihakalili mizuka kuhuma kwa vandu venavo. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Ndi kila mundu alingayi kumpamisa, muni makakala gamuhumayi mwene na kuvalamisa vandu voha.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luheku na ngolongondi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matei 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Yesu akavalola vawuliwa vaki akavajovela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">Mhekayi nyenye mwavangangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">muni Unkosi wa Chapanga ndi winu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Mhekayi nyenye mwemuvi na njala hinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">muni yati mwiyukuta!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Mhekayi nyenye mwemvemba hinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">muni yati muheka kwa luheku!<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>Mhekayi, nyenye, ngati vandu vavagani lepi, amala kuvabagula, amala kuvaliga na kugahakasa mahina ginu ndava ya Mwana wa Mundu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Lukumbi genago pegihumila, mhekayi na kukina, muni njombi yinu yivaha kunani kwa Chapanga. Ndava muni vagogo vavi vavakitili vamlota va Chapanga mewawa.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>“Nambu mwalachikolela nyenye mwemuvi na vindu vyamahele hinu, ndava mmali kupoleswa mitima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">yati mpoleswa lepi kavili mitima yinu.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Mwalachikolela nyenye mwemwiyukuta hinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">muni njala yati yikuvavina!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Mwalachikolela nyenye mwemuheka hinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">mwalavemba na kuvya milyangu.”<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>“Mwalachikolela nyenye ngati vandu voha vakuvalumbalila, muni vagogo vavi vavalumbalili vamlota va Chapanga vaudese mewawa.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mvagana makoko vinu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matei 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>“Nambu nikuvajovela nyenye mwemukuniyuwanila, muvagana vandu vevavi makoko vinu, muvakitila gabwina vandu vangavagana nyenye. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Muvamotisa vala vevalapikisa likoto, muvawombelayi vala vevakuvakitila gahakau. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Ngati mundu yoyoha yula akutovili mulitama, veve mung'anamusila na lingi. Ngati mundu akunyagili likoti laku, mewa veve mulekelayi na nyula. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Mundu yoyoha yula mweakukuyupa chindu veve mpelayi, ngati mudu akunyagi vindu vyaku, veve kotoka kumjovela akuwuyisila. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Ngati chemwigana vandu vangi vavakitilayi, na nyenye muvakitila vene mewawa.”<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>“Ngati mukuvagana nga vandu vevakuvagana nyenye mwavene, mwipata njombi yoki? Kawaka! Muni na vevakumbudila Chapanga na vene viganana mewa. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Na, ngati mukuvakitila gakumganisa Chapanga nga vala vevakuvawuyisila, nyenye mwipata njombi yoki? Muni hati vandu vevakumbudila Chapanga, vikita mewawa, <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>na ngati mukuvayaika vandu vemuvahuvalila vavawuyisilayi ndu, mwipata njombi kiki? Muni na vandu vevakumbudila Chapanga vakuvayayika mewawa vayavi, ndava vawuyisiwayi. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Nambu nyenye muvaganayi makoko vinu, mvakitila gabwina, na pemukuvayaika mkotoka kugana kuwuyisiwa kavili. Ndi penapo njombi yinu yati yivya yivaha na nyenye yati mwivya vana va Chapanga Mkulu. Muni mwene akuvagana vandu vangamsengusa na vahakau. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Muvya na lipyana ngati Dadi winu cheavi na lipyana.”<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvahamula vangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matei 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>“Mkotoka kuvahamula vangi, na Chapanga yati akuvahamula lepi, mkotoka kuvalaumu vayinu na nyenye yati mwilaumiwa lepi, muvalekelekesa vayinu na Chapanga yati avalekelekesa nyenye. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Muvapela vangi gevigana, na Chapanga yati avapela nyenye, ndi mupokela mulihaku linu. Ndava muni chipimu chichocho chemvahengela vangi na nyenye yati mpokela kuhuma kwa Chapanga, chipimu cha bwina cha kumema na kuhindiliwa na kunyuguswa mbaka kuyitika.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Yesu akavajovela luhumu ulu, “Wu, ngalola, ihotola kumlongosa ngalola muyaki? Lepi! Voha yati vidumbukila muligodi. <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Muwuliwa mkulu lepi kuliku muwula waki, nambu akawuliwayi na kumanya ndi iwanangana na muwula waki.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>Ndava kyani ulola lungoda lweluvi mulihu la mlongo waku, nambu wamwene uvi na lumbagalu mulihu laku? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Uhotola wuli kumjovela mlongo waku, ‘Chondi nikuwusayi lungoda mulihu laku,’ Kuni nakuluwona lumbagalu mulihu laku wamwene? Mweukujikita mbwina veve! Wusa hoti lumbagalu mulihu laku ndi yati ulola bwina kuwusa kabasi mulihu la mlongo waku.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mkongo na umanyikana ndava ya matunda gaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matei 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>“Mewawa mkongo wabwina upambika lepi matunda gahakau na wala mkongo uhakau upambika lepi matunda gabwina. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Mkongo wowoha wula umanyikana ndava ya matunda gaki. Muni vandu viyava lepi matunda ga tini mumkongo wa michongoma na wala viyava lepi zabibu mumbigili. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Mundu mbwina iwusa vindu vyabwina kuhuma muvindu yveavikili muchibana cha mtima waki na mundu mhakau iwusa vindu vihakau kuhuma muchibana cha mtima waki. Ndava muni mundu ilongela gegamemili mumtima waki.”<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa vajenzi vavili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matei 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>“Ndava kyani mukunikemela ‘Bambu, Bambu,’ Kuni mwihenga lepi chenikuvajovela? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Nikuvapela luhumu lwa mundu yula mweibwela kwa nene, akugayuwana malovi gangu na kuhenga chenijova. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Mwenuyo iwanangana ngati mundu mweijenga nyumba, mwe agimili mkingisa neju mbaka akaukolela litalau, akatumbula kujenga penapo. Peyaumili mfuleni kumema manji gana makakala na kuyitova nyumba yila, nambu nyumba yila yanyugusiki lepi, ndava yajengiwi chakukangamala. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Nambu mundu yula mweiyuwana malovi gangu na ihenga lepi chindu chochoha, mwenuyo iwanangana na mundu mweajengili nyumba panani ya ludaka changali kugima mkingisa neju. Peyahumili mifuleni kumema manji gana makakala, gakayitova nyumba yila, yikagwa na kudenyekana nyiminyimi!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mtumisi wa mkulu mmonga wa vandu va ngondo va Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matei 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Yesu peamali kujova ago kwa vandu akahamba ku Kapelanaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Kwenuko kwavili na mkulu mmonga wa vandu va ngondo va ku Loma, mwenuyo avi na mtumisi, mweamyidikili neju mwealwala mulung'olelu.<figure style="fig" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" ref="7:2">Mkulu wa ngondo</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Mkulu yula wa Loma peayuwini mambu ga Yesu, akavatuma vagogo vangi va Vayawudi vakamuyupayi abwela kumulamisa mtumisi waki. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Pevahikili kwa Yesu, vakamjovela, “pepayi bambu, mundu mwenuyu, yitakiwa atangatiwayi. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Ndava mwenuyu akuvagana vandu vitu, kangi ndi mweatijengili nyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Ndi Yesu akahamba nawu. Pavahegalili pa nyumba ya mkulu yula, ndi mkulu akavatuma vankozi vaki vakamjovelayi Yesu, “Bambu, kotoka kujing'aha. Muni nene nakujiwona ngati nabwina hati veve kuyingila mumyumba yangu, <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Kangi, nikajiweni nabwina lepi, nene kubwela kwa veve. Nambu jovayi ngalilovi na mtumisi wangu yati ilama. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Ndava muni nene mewa, mundu mwenivikiwi pahi ya uhotola wa vakulu vangu nivi na manjolinjoli, nikamjovelayi mmonga, ‘Hambayi!’ Ihamba, nikamjovela yungi, ‘Bwelayi!’ Na mwene ibwela, Nikamjovelayi na mvanda wangu, ‘Kita naha!’ Namwene ikita.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yesu akakangasa paayuwini genago, akaung'anamukila msambi wa vandu wewamlandali, akavajovela, “Niloli lepi sadika yivaha ngati iyi hati pagati ya vandu va Isilaeli!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Ndi vandu vala pavawuyili kunyumba vakamkolela mtumisi yula alamili.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amuyusa mwana wa lipwela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Chilau yaki, Yesu akahamba kumuji umonga weukemelewa Naini, na vawuliwa vaki pamonga na msambi wa vandu ukalongosana nayu. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Ndi pavahegalili papipi na mlyangu mkulu wa muji, vakakonganeka na vandu vavagegili mtuhi wa msongolo mmonga, mwana yuyoyo ndu wa lipwela. Vandu vamahele va pamuji wenuwo vavi pamonga na mau mwenuyo. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Bambu Yesu paamuweni mau yula, akamhengela lipyana akamjovela, “Kotoka kuvemba.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Kangi Yesu akahamba na kupamisa lusongwani chavagegili mtuhi na vavagegili vala vakayima. Akajova, “Wamsongolo veve! Nijova yimuka!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Mweafwi yula akayima akatumbula kulongela. Yesu akampela mau yula mwana waki.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Ndi vandu voha vakavya na wogohi, vakatumbula kumulumbalila Chapanga. Vakajova, “Mlota mkulu wa Chapanga atihumali pagati yitu, Chapanga abwelili kuvatangila vandu vaki.”<verse eid="LUK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Mambu genago gakadandasika pamulima woha wa Yudea na milima yoha yeyavi papipi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vajumbi kuhuma kwa Yohani Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matei 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Vawuliwa vaki Yohani pevamjovili mambu goha. Ndi akavakemela vawuliwa vavili, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>akavatuma kwa Bambu vakamkotayi, “Veve ndi msangula mweibwela, amala timulindila yungi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Pavahikili kwa Yesu, vakamjovela, “Yohani Mbatizaji atitumili tikukotayi, ngati veve ndi msangula mweibwela, amala timlindila yungi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Lukumbi lwenulo vamkoli Yesu avalamisayi vandu vamahele vevavi na matamu na vana mizuka yihakau akayiwusa, na vangalola vamahele akavakita kulola. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Ndi akavajovela muhamba mukamjovela Yohani goha gemugaweni na kuyuwana. Vangalola vilola, vangagenda vigenda, vanamabudi vinyambiswa, vangayuwa viyuwana, vavafwili vihyukiswa, na vangangu vikokosewa Lilovi la Bwina. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Ahekayi mundu yula mweangayoma ndava ya nene!<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Vajumbi va Yohani vala pavawukili, ndi Yesu akatumbula kuukota msambi wa vandu gakumuvala Yohani, “Pamwahambili kulugangatu kumlola Yohani, mwaganili kulola kiki? Wu, mwaholalili kumlola mundu mweavi ngati lidete lelinyuguswa na mpungu? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Hinu, mwahambili kulola kiki? Mundu mwaawali nyula za nyililili? Vandu veviwala chakujinyambisa na kutama wumi wabwina, venavo vavi munyumba za vankosi. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Munijovela chemukahambili kulola? Mlota wa Chapanga? Ena, chakaka kangi neju ya Mlota wa Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Yohani mwenuyu ndi malovi gayandikiwi mu Mayandiku kumvala mwene, ‘Lola nene nikumtuma mjumbi wangu akulongolela, ndava ya kukukwalila njila yaku.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Yesu akamalakisila kujova,” “Kawaka mundu, mweavelikiwi na mdala mkulu kuliku Yohani Mbatizaji. Nambu mweavi mdebe muunkosi wa Chapanga, mwenuyo ndi mkulu kuliku mwene.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Vandu voha pamonga na vatola kodi vevabatiziwi na Yohani, pevayuwini genago, vakayidakila Chapanga ndi mchakaka. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Nambu Vafalisayu na vawula va Malagizu vala vevabatiziwi lepi na Yohani, ndi vabeli mpangu wa Chapanga ndava ya mambu gavi.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Yesu akavajovela, “Chiveleku cha vandu ava kwali nivawanangisa na kyani? Vene vandu ava valingini na kiki? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Vavi ngati vana vevatamii pandu pakugulisila vindu vikemelana, chikundi chimonga na chiyaki, ‘Tivabetili chitolilo nambu nyenye mwanga kina! Tivayimbili nyimbu za malilu nambu muvembi lepi!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Yohani peabweli, ajihinisi chakulya wala kunywa divayi, mkamjova ‘Mwenuyu anamzuka!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Mwana wa Mundu abwelili, ilya na kunywa, nyenye mujova, ‘Mumlola muhutulu na chigaligali uyu, nkozi wa vatola kodi na vandu vevakumbudila Chapanga!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Nambu luhala lwa Chapanga lulangisa, yakuvya chakaka kwa voha vevakuluyidakila.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu munyumba ya Simoni Mfalisayu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Mfalisayu mmonga amgongolili Yesu kulya panyumba yaki. Akayingila munyumba ya Mfalisayu yula na kutama kulya. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Ndi pamuji wenuwo avi mdala mmonga wumi waki atamayi kumbudila Chapanga. Akayuwana Yesu avili munyumba ya Mfalisayu uyu, ndi akatola chupa yeyahongoliwi kwa liganga la alabasta yeyavi na mahuta ga kunungalila bwina. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Akayima papipi na magendelu ga Yesu kuni avembayi, na maholi gaki gamudonyokela Yesu mumagendelu, akahungula magendelu ga Yesu na mayunju gaki, akagabusu magendelu gala na kunyala mahuta genago. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Mfalisayu mweamugongolili Yesu pealoli genago akaholalela mumtima waki, “Mwe mundu uyu ngaavi chakaka mlota wa Chapanga, ngaammanyi mdala mweampamisi, kuvya mweakumbudila Chapanga!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yesu akamjovela mfalisayu yula. “Simoni, chivii chindu chenigana kukujovela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Simoni, akamyangula, “Ena muwula, jovayi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Yesu akajova, “Vandu vavili vamuyahiki mundu mashonga. Mmonga ayayiki mashonga ga luhuna lwa mwaka umonga na miheyi sita na yungi ayaiki mashonga ga luhuna lwa mwehi umonga na majuma gavili. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Voha vavili vavilepi na mashonga ga kuwuyisa, mundu yula avahulumili voha. Hinu yani mweakumugana neju bambu yula?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simoni akamyangula, “Chakaka mweahulumiwi mashonga ga mahele yula alamugana neju bambu yula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesu akamjovela, “Uhamwili chabwina.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Kangi akamng'anamukila mdala yula na akamjovela Simoni, “Umlola mdala uyu? Penikayingili munyumba yaku unipeli lepi manji gakusamba mumagendelu gangu, nambu mdala uyu anitepatisi magendelu gangu na maholi gaki na kuhungula na mayunju gaki. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Penikayingili unikemili lepi chakunibusu mulitama, nambu mdala uyu kutumbula panakayingila hakotwiki lepi kunijambusa cha kunibusu litama laki mumagendelu gangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Uninyalili lepi mahuta ga zeituni kumutu veve, nambu mdala uyu aninyalili mahuta geginungalila bwina mumagendelu gangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Nikukujovela, alekekisiwi kumbudila Chapanga pamahele ndava muni alangisi uganu uvaha. Nambu mundu mwealekekiswi kumbudila Chapanga padebe ilangisa uganu udebe.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Yesu akamjovela mdala yula, “Ulekekiswi goha geumbudili Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Vandu vala vavatamili na Yesu pakulya pala, vakatumbula kukotana, “Mundu uyu ndi yani? Hati ihotola kulekekesa vandu vevakumbudila Chapanga?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Ndi Yesu akamjovela mdala yula, “Kusadika kwaku kukulamisi, uhamba na uteke.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Vadala vevalongosini na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Pagamaliki ago Yesu akahamba mumiji na muhijiji hingi kuvajovela vandu Lilovi la Bwina la Unkosi wa Chapanga. Vawuliwa vaki kumi na vavili vakalongosana nayu. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>Pamonga na vadala vevawusiwi mizuka na vevalamisiwi matamu na Yesu, venavo vavi, Maliya mkolonjinji wa Magidala mweawusiwi mizuka saba yihakau, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>na Yoana mdala waki Kuza, Kuza mweavi myimilila nyumba ya Helodi, Susana na vadala vangi vamahele. Vevawusili vindu yavi ndava ya kumtangatila Yesu na vawuliwa vaki vayendelela na lihengu lavi.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa mundu mmija mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matei 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maluko 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Vandu vamahele vambwelalili Yesu kuhuma kukila muji, na msambi uvaha pawakonganiki, Yesu akavajovela luhumu ulu.<verse eid="LUK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>Mundu mweahambili kumija mbeyu zaki. Na peamija mbeyu, zingi zikagwilila munjila na vandu vakazilivatila, na videge vikahola. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Zingi zikagwilila paludaka luna maganga pezatumbulayi kumela zikanyala muni pavi lepi na manji. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Zingi zikagwilila muminga, ndi minga zikamela pamonga nazu, zikazihinya. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Zingi zagwili paludaka lwabwina, zikamela limonga likapambika ng'onyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Yesu akamalisila kwa lwami luvaha, “Mweavi na makutu ga kuyuwana ayuwana!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndava ya luhumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matei 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maluko 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Vawuliwa vaki vakamkota Yesu, luhumu lula mana yaki kyani. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Mwene akavayangula, “Nyenye muhotiswi kumanya ufiyu wa Unkosi wa Chapanga, nambu lepi kwa avo vangi, vene vijoviwa kwa luhumu, muni vakalolayi nakuhotola kulola na vakayuwana nakumanya.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu idandaula luhumu lwa mmija mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matei 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maluko 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>“Luhumu ulu mana yaki. Mbeyu ndi lilovi la Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Chechihumili kwa mbeyu zezagwili munjila, ndi luhumu lwa vandu veviyuwana lilovi la Chapanga, kangi Setani peibwela na kuliwusa mumitima yavi vakotoka kusadika na kusanguliwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Mewawa chechehumili kwa mbeyu zezagwili pamaganga, ndi luhumu wa vandu veviyuwana lilovi na kulipokela kwa luheku. Nambu vandu vangali mikiga mugati yavi, na lukumbi pevilingiwa vikotoka. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Kangi chechihumili kwa mbeyu zezagwili paminga, ndi luhumu wa vandu veviyuwana lilovi la Chapanga, pa lukumbi luhupi peviyendelela na Lilovi lenilo, vene vihinyiwa na mahengu ga kuvya na vindu vyamahele na mambu ga bwina ga pamulima, ndi na kupambika matunda gakakangala. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Ndi mbeyu zezagwili paludaka lwabwina, ndi luhumu wa vandu vevayuwini lilovi na kulivika mumitima yavi na kuyidakila bwina. Vikangamala mumitima mbaka kupambika matunda.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hahi yeyigubikiwi na chiviga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maluko 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>“Vandu vipambika lepi hahi na kuyigubika na chiviga amala kuyivika kuhi kuchitanda. Nambu vandu vivika hahi panani pachibokoselu, muni vandu veviyingila mugati valola bwina.”<verse eid="LUK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>“Muni chochoha chechifiyiki, yati chigubukuliwa na chindu chochoha cha mfiyu yati chimanyikana na voha.”<verse eid="LUK 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>“Mujiyangalilayi chemwiyuwana, muni mweavi nachu yati iyonjokeswa, nambu mundu mwanga chindu, hati chila chidebe cheihololela kuvya nachu yati chinyagiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyina waki na valongo vaki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matei 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maluko 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Nyina waki na valongo vaki Yesu vakamuhambalila, ndava ya msambi wa vandu wula nakuhotola kumuhegelela. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Mundu mmonga akamjovela Yesu, “Nyina waku na valongo vaku vayimili kuvala, vigana kukulola.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Nambu Yesu akavajovela vandu, “Nyina wangu na valongo vangu ndi vala veviyuwana lilovi la Chapanga na kulikamula.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu igunisa chimbungululu na luyuga lwa manji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matei 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maluko 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Na kavili ligono limonga Yesu peakweli muwatu pamonga na vawuliwa vaki, akavajovela, “Tikupuka kumwambu ya nyanja.” Vakatumbula kukupuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Pavahambayi muwatu wula, Yesu agonili lugono. Ndi chimbungululu chikatumbula kutova munyanja mula na manji gakatumbula kuyingila muwatu wavi mkulemala neju.<verse eid="LUK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Vawuliwa vaki vamhambali vakamuyumusa na vakamjovela, “Bambu, Bambu Tifwa!” Yesu akayumuka, akachilakalila chimbungululu chila na luyuga lwa manji ndi vikaguna na kukavya teke. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Kangi akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Kusadika kwinu kuvi koki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Vene vakakangasa na kuyogopa kuni vijovelana, “Mundu uyu wa namuna yoki? Hati ihotola kugunisa chimbungululu na luyuga na vyene vimyidikila!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa mgosi ana mizuka wa ku Gelasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matei 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maluko 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Vakakupuka na kuhika kumbwani ya kumuji wa mulima wa Vagelasi wewalolasini na Galilaya kumwambu ya nyanja. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Yesu peahulwiki muwatu na kulivatila mbwani, mundu mmonga wa muji wula, mweavi na mizuka ambwelalili. Mundu mwenuyo kwa magono gamahele awala lepi nyula wala atamili lepi munyumba yoyoha yila, ndi atamali mumbugu la kuzikila vandu. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Peamuweni Yesu akavemba kwa lwami luvaha na kumgwilila pamagendelu, “Wa, Yesu veve Mwana wa Chapanga Mkulu! Una kyani na nene? Pepayi chonde kotoka kuning'aha!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Ajovili genago muni Yesu amali kuuhakalila mzuka wula umuwukayi mundu yula. Pamahele mzuka wamzangila mundu yula pamonga na vandu kumuvika mugati na kumkunga minyololo mu mawoko na mumagendelu nambu pamahele adenyayi vifungo vyenivyo, na kujumbiswa kwa makakala ga mzuka wenuwo mbaka kulugangatu.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yesu akamkota, “Liina laku yani?” Akayangula, “Liina langu Msambi.” Ndava mizuka yamahele yamuyingili. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Mizuka yila yikamjovela Yesu pepayi chonde akotoka kuyipeleka kuligodi langali mwishu.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Kwavi na maguluvi gamahele gevadimayi kuchitumbi pandu penapo, ndi mizuka yila yikamuyupa Yesu yihamba kuyingila mumaguluvi gala. Yesu akayileka yihamba. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Ndi mizuka yila yikamuwuka mundu yula yikagayingila maguluvi gala, na msambi wa maguluvi ukahelela munyanja na kuyongomela, gakafwa mumanji.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Vadimaji va maguluvi pevaloli gegahumali vakajumba, kuhamba kumuji na kumigunda kuvajovela vandu ujumbi. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Vandu vakabwela kulola gegahumalili, vakamuhambalila Yesu, vamuwene mundu mwe yamuhumili mizuka yula, atamili papipi na magendelu ga Yesu, awali nyula, na avi na luhala lwaki bwina. Voha vakayogopa. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Vandu vevagaweni mambu genago, vakavajovela vayavi chealamiswi mundu yula. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Vakolonjinji voha wa ku Gelasi vakavya na wogohi neju. Vakamuyupa Yesu awukayi ahamba kungi. Yesu akakwela muwatu akawuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Mundu mweamuwusi mizuka yula, amuyupili Yesu valongosanayi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Nambu Yesu nakumuyidakila, ndi akamjovela, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>“Wuya kunyumba yaku ukavajovelayi gaakuhengili Chapanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Ndi mundu yula akahamba kila pandu kumuji woha akuvajovela vandu chaamhengili Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana wa Yailusi na mdala mmonga vilamiswa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matei 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maluko 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Yesu paawuyili kumwambu yingi ya nyanja, avakoli msambi wa vandu vampokali chaluheku, ndava voha vamlindilayi. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Penapo akabwela mundu mmonga liina laki Yailusi avi chilongosi wa nyumba ya kukonganekela akamfugamila Yesu mumagendelu, akamuyupa Yesu ahamba kunyumba yaki, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>muni msikana waki ngayuyoyo mmonga, wa miiyaka kumi na yivili avi mtamu papipi kufwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu avi mukuhamba, msambi wa vandu wavi kumuhinya kila upandi. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Kwavi na mdala mmonga pagati ya msambi wula wa vandu, avi na utamu wa kuhuma ngasi miyaka kumi na yivili, amalili kuwusa vindu vyaki vyoha kuvapela valamisa, kawaka mweahotwili kumlamisa. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Mdala yula akamlanda Yesu mumbele akapamisa lugunyilu lwa pahi lwa nyula ya Yesu. Bahapo akalama. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yesu akajova, “Yani mweanipamisi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Vandu vakajova, Kawaka mundu mwaakupamisi. Petili akajova, “Bambu msambi wa vandu vakutindili na kukuhinya!”<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Nambu Yesu akajova, “Avili mundu mweanipamisi, muni nijiyuwini makakala ganihumili.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Mdala yula paajiloli nakuhotola kujifiha, akabwela kuni hivagaya akamfugamila Yesu mumagendelu. Akamjovela pavandu voha ndava ya kumpamisa Yesu na chaalami bahapo. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Yesu akamjovela, “Msikana wangu, kusadika kwaku kukulamisi, uhamba na uteke.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Yesu paavi akona ilongela, akabwela mundu kuhuma kunyumba ya Yailo, akamjovela Yailo, “Leka kumung'aha Muwula, mwana waku mwene afwili.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Yesu peayuwini genago, akamjovela Yailo, “Kotoka kuyogopa, sadika ndu, yati ilama.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Peahikili panyumba pala, akavatola Petili na Yohani na Yakobo pamonga na dadi na nyina wa msikana yula akayingila nawu mugati, vandu vangi avalekili kuvala. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Vandu voha vavembayi na malilu kwa lipyanda ndava ya mwana yula. Nambu Yesu akavajovela, “Mkotoka kuvemba, muni mwana uyu afwili lepi, agonili ndu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Voha vakamuheka, muni vamanyili kuvya mwana yula afwili. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Kangi Yesu akamkamula chiwoko mwana yula na kumkemela, “Mwana yimuka!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Mpungu waki ukamuwuyila, bahapo akayimuka. Yesu akavajovela mumpela chakulya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Dadi na nyina wa mwana yula vakakangasa, Nambu Yesu akavajovela vakotoka kumjovela mundu yoyoha mambu gala gegahengiki.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvatuma vawuliwa kumi na vavili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matei 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maluko 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Yesu akavakemela vawuliwa vaki kumi na vavili pamonga akavapela makakala na uhotola panani ya mizuka yoha na kulamisa matamu. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Kangi akavatuma vahamba vakakokosa Unkosi wa Chapanga na kulamisa vatamu. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Akavajovela, “Mkotoka kutola chindu chochoha chila mulugendu lwinu ngati ndonga amala lihaku amala chakulya amala mashonga amala kuvya na magwanda gavili pagati yinu. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Nyumba yeyoha yemwiyingila na vavapokili mutama penapo mbaka pemwiwuka pamuji wenuwo, <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Na vandu ngati vabelili kuvapokela, muwukayi pamuji wenuwo, na pemwiwuka muvakung'undila lububu lwa mumagendelu ginu kuvalangisa kuvya vene vahagwili kubela ujumbi wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Vawuliwa vakawuka penapo, vakahamba muhijiji na kuvakokosela vandu Lilovi la bwina na kuvalamisa vandu vana matamu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nkosi Helodi ivagaya ndava ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matei 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maluko 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Hinu, nkosi Helodi peayuwini mambu goha gegahengiki, akavagaya ndava muni vandu vajovayi, “Yohani Mbatizaji ayukili!” <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Vangi vakajova Eliya ahumalili na vangi vakajova mwenuyu mmonga wavi vamlota va Chapanga va kadeni vawuyili pamulima. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Nambu Helodi akajova, “Ngati Yohani namdumwili mutu, hinu yani mwenuyu mweniyuwana malovi gaki?” Akanogela kumlola.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilisa msambi wa vandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matei 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohani 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Vamitumi vala pavawuyili vakamjovela Yesu goha gavahengili. Yesu akavatola vene, akahamba nawu kuchiyepela kumuji wavaukemela Betisaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Nambu msambi wa vandu pawamanyili kwa ahambili Yesu vakamlanda. Yesu avapokili, akavajovela malovi ga Unkosi wa Chapanga na kuvalamisa vandu voha vevavi na matamu vakalama.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Lilanga palatumbula kutipama, vawuliwa kumi na vavili vala vakamjovela, “Valagayi vandu vahamba muhijiji na mumigunda ya papipi vakajilondela vyakulya na pandu pa kugona muni petivii palugangatu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Nambu Yesu akavajovela, “Muvapelayi nyenye chindu chakulya.” Vakamyangula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">“Tete tivii na mabumunda mhanu na somba zivili ndu. Manya tihamba tikavagulila vyakulya msambi uwu woha.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Muni vavi vagosi, ngati elufu mhanu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesu akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Muvajovela vandu vatamayi hikundi ya vandu ngati hamsini hamsini.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Vawuliwa vakakita ngati cha avajovili, vakavatamisa voha. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Yesu akatola mabumunda mhanu na somba zivili zila, akalola kunani, akayimotisa, akayinukula akavapela vawuliwa vaki vavagavanisila vandu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Vandu voha valili na kuyukuta. Ndi vakanonga na kumemesa madengu kumi na gavili ga hipandi yeyisigalili.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petili ammanya Yesu kuvya Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matei 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maluko 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Ligono limonga Yesu ayupayi kwa Chapanga mwene ndu, na vawuliwa vaki vavi papipi. Ndi, akavakota, “Vandu vijova kuvya nene ndi nayani?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Vene vakamyangula, “Vangi vijova veve Yohani Mbatizaji na vangi vijova Eliya na vangi vijova wa mmonga wa vamlota va Chapanga va kadeni mweayukili.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Penapo Yesu akavakota, “Nambu nyenye mwijova kuvya nene ndi yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Petili akamyangula, “Veve ndi Kilisitu Msangula mwauhumili kwa Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilotela ndava ya lifwa na kuyuka kwaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matei 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Maluko 8:30-9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Kangi Yesu akavalagiza na kuvabesa vakotokayi kumjovela mundu yoyoha yula genago. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Mewa akavajovela, “Mwana wa Mundu iganikiwa kung'ahika neju na kubelelewa na vagogo na Vakulu va Kuteta na vawula va malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa na kukomewa na muligono la datu yati iyuka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Ndi akavajovela vandu voha, “Mundu yoyoha yula mweigana kunilanda na ajibelayi hoti mwene agega msalaba waki magono goha anilandayi. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Muni mundu mweigana kuugombola wumi waki yati awuyagisa na yoyoha mweauyagisa wumi waki kwa kunilanda nene yati akuusangula. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Ngati mundu apatili vindu vyoha pamulima apa kuni iyagisa amala kujikomakesa mwene wumi waki, mundu mwenuyo apatili chindu kiki chabwina? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Ndava muni mundu yeyoha yula ngati ikola soni kwa nene na mawuliwu gangu, Mwana wa Mundu, yati ikola soni kwa mundu mwenuyo peibwelayi muukulu waki na wa Dadi waki na mitumu va msopi wa kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Chakaka nikuvajovela, vavi vandu vangi penapa yati vifwa lepi changaulola Unkosi wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulolekanu wa Yesu wing'anamuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matei 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maluko 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Magono nane kuhuma Yesu peavajovili malovi genago, ndi Yesu akavatola Petili na Yohani na Yakobo kuhamba nawu kuchitumbi kumuyupa kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Peavili mukuyupa Chapanga, ulolekanu wa pamihu paki pang'anamwiki na nyula zaki zikavya zamsopi na kung'asima neju. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Bahapo vandu vavili vawonikini kulongela nayu, vandu vene vavi Musa na Eliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>vahumili muukulu, ndi valongela nayu ndava ya lifwa laki, na kukita lihengu lelimalikisila ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Petili na vayaki vavi mulugono tipi tipi, nambu pavayimwiki vauwene ukulu wa Yesu, vavawene na vandu veayimili nawu vala. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Pavamlekili, Petili akamjovela Yesu, “Bambu, nilola chabwina tete kutama bahapa! Hinu tijengi tundanda tudatu, chimonga chaku na chingi cha Musa na chingi cha Eliya.” Chakaka mwene nakumanya chavamjovili.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Petili peajovayi ago, bahapo lihundi likahumila na kuvahulukila ndi lihundi palavahulukili vene vavi na wogohi neju. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Lwami lukayuwanika mulihundi mula. “Mwenuyu ndi Mwana vangu mwenimuhagwili, mumyuwanila.”<verse eid="LUK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Lwami lula Palwayuwanika, Yesu awonakini avi mwene. Vawuliwa vaki vakavya nuu mu mambu genago na lukumbi lwenulo kawaka mundu mwavamjovili. Gevagaweni.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amulamisa mwana ana mzuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matei 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maluko 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Chilau yaki Yesu pamonga na vawuliwa vadatu vala vahelelayi kuhuma kuchitumbi kula, vakakonganeka na msambi wa vandu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Penapo mundu mmonga akamkemela na kujova, “Muwula! Chondi mhengela lipyana mwana vangu, muni avili ngayuyu mwene! <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Yuwanila mzuka ukumzangila, na bahapo liywanga, kuni litovesa ligoji na lihuluhulu lihuma mumlomo, na likumung'aisa palukumbi lutali changamleka. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Navayupili vawuliwa vaku vauvinga mzuka wula, nambu nakuhotola.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yesu akayangula, akajova, “Nyenye chiveleku changasadika, na chechiyagili, yati nitama na nyenye na kuvasindimalila mbaka ndali?” Ndi akamjovela mkolo mwana yula, “Mleta mwana waku apa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Mwana yula peambwelili Yesu, mzuka ukamgwisa pahi na kumsopa ligoji. Nambu Yesu akauhakalila mzuka wula na kumlamisa mwana yula, akampela dadi waki. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Vandu voha vakakangasa makakala gakulu ga Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu ijova kangi ndava ya lifwa laki</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matei 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maluko 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Vandu pavavi vakona vikangasa ndava ya mambu geagahengili, Yesu akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>“Muyuwanila bwina malovi aga, Mwana wa Mundu ihamba kusopiwa mumawoko ga vandu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Nambu vawuliwa vaki vavi nakugamanya malovi gaavajovili muni malovi gala gafiyiki kwavi ndava vakotoka kugamanya. Na vene vavi na wogohi kumkota mana ya malovi ago.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yani mkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matei 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maluko 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Vawuliwa va Yesu vakatumbula kukotana veve kwa veve, yani mkulu kuliku voha. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Yesu amanyili maholo ga mumitima yavi, ndi akamtola mwana mng'enya, akamuvika papipi yaki, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>na akavajovela, “Mundu mweakumpokela mwana mdebe uyu kwa liina langu, mwenuyo akunipokela nene, na mundu yeyoha yula mweakunipokela nene, akumpokela mweanitumili. Muni mundu mweavi mdebe pagati yinu, ndi mkulu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mweangali luhonda na nyenye avi upandi winu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maluko 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Yohani akamjovela Yesu, “Bambu, tikamuweni mundu ivinga mizuka kwa liina laku na tete talingili kumbesa ndava mwene alongosini lepi na tete.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Yesu akavajovela, “Mkotoka kulinga kumbesa, ndava yeyoha mwangatovana na nyenye avi upandi winu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vasamaliya va chijiji chimonga vibela kumpokela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Lukumbi lwa Yesu palwahegalili lwa kutoliwa kuhamba kunani kwa Chapanga, ndi Yesu akagana neju kuhamba ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Na, avatumili vajumbi vamulongolela, vakayingila muchijiji chimonga cha Vasamaliya ndava ya kumtendelekeha bwina kila chindu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Nambu vakolo njinji va penapo nakugana kumpokela Yesu ndava vamanyili ngati Yesu aganili kuhamba ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Lukumbi vawuliwa vaki vakina Yohani na Yakobo pavaloli genago, vakajova, “Bambu ugana tilagizayi motu kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga luvatinyisayi?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Nambu Yesu akavang'anamukila, akavahakalila. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Kangi Yesu na vawuliwa vaki vakahamba kuchijiji chingi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Veviganakiwa kuvya vamulanda va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matei 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Pavagendayi munjila, mundu mmonga akamjovela Yesu, “Yati nikulanda kokoha kula kwewihamba.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yesu akamjovela, “Mahogo gana mbugu za kugona na videge vina chisakanilu nambu mwana wa Mundu avi lepi na pandu pakupumulila.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Yesu akamjovela mundu yungi, “Nilandayi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Nambu mundu yula akamyangula, “Bambu, nileka hoti nihamba nikamuzika dadi wangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Nambu Yesu akamyangula, “Valeka vevafwili vavazikayi vevafwili vavi, nambu veve uhamba ukakokosa Unkosi wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Na mundu yungi akamjovela, “Bambu yati nikukulanda, nambu nikuyupa nikavalaga hoti vandu va kunyumba yangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Nambu Yesu akamyangula, “Mundu yeyoha mweikamula ligela kutumbula kulima kuni ilolokesa mumbele, mwenuyo nakuganikiwa muunkosi wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvatuma vevakumlanda sabini na vavili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Pagamaliki genago, Bambu akavahagula vandu vangi sabini na vavili, akavatuma vavili vavili vamulongolela kukila chijiji na kungi kweagana mwene kuhamba. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Akavajovela, “Mabenu gamahele, nambu vabenaji vadebe. Mumuyupa mkolo mgunda avatuma vabenaji kumgunda waki. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Hinu muhamba! Mumanya kuvya nikuvatuma nyenye ngati limbelele gegihamba pagati ya libwa la mudahi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Mkotoka kutola chihaku cha mashonga amala lihaku wala Champali na munjila, mkotoka kumjambusa mundu yoyoha yula. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Nyumba yoyoha yemuyingila, muvajambusa, ‘Uteke uvyayi munyumba iyi.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Ngati avi mundu mweigana uteke, ndi uteke winu yati yitama na mwene! Ngati avi lepi, uteke winu yivawuyila mwavene. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Mutama panyumba yeniyo, mlyayi na kunywa vyevakuvapela. Ndava muni mwanalihengu yiganikiwa apewa njombi yaki. Mkotoka kuwuka panyumba iyi na kuhamba panyumba yila. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Pamuji wowoha wemuhikila na vandu ngati vavapokalili, mlyayi vyevakuvapela. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Muvalamisa vana matamu vevavi kwenuko, muvajovela vandu, Unkosi wa Chapanga uvi papipi na nyenye. <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Nambu mukayingili pamuji wowoha wula na vakolo muji nakuvapokela, muwuka penapo, na pemwigenda munjila zavi mujova. <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‘Pamonga na lububu lwa muji winu lweluvi mumagendelu gitu, tikuvahungulila kulangisa mwavene muhagwili kubela ujumbi wa Chapanga. Nambu, mumanyalila kuvya, Unkosi wa Chapanga uvi papipi na nyenye!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Chakaka nikuvajovela, ligono la muhalu ukulu, Chapanga yati avalipisa pavaha kwa uhakau winu kuliku vandu va ku Sodoma!”<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Miji yanga muwuyila Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matei 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>“Walachikolela veve Kolazini! Walachikolela veve Betisaida! Muni, gachinamtiti yeyakitiki kwinu, kuvya nga gakitiki ku Tilo na ku Sidoni, kutumbula penapo vandu vaki ngavamali kuwala nyula za magunila na kutama palyenge kulangisa vamuwuyili Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Hinu ligono la muhalu mkulu, Chapanga yati akuvabuna pavaha kuliku vandu va ku Tilo na ku Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Na veve Kapelanaumu, yati ukujikwiha mbaka kunani kwa Chapanga? Lepi yati vakuhulusa mbaka kuligodi litali langali mwishu!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Kangi Yesu akajova, “Mundu mweakuvayuwanila nyenye, akuniyuwanila nene na mundu mweibela kuvapokela nyenye, ibela kunipokela nene. Na mundu yoyoha mweibela kunipokela nene, ibela kumpokela mweanitumili nene.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vawuliwa sabini na vavili viwuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Vawuliwa vala sabini na vavili vawuyili kuni visangaluka vakamjovela, “Bambu na mizuka nayene yikatiyidakili petakayihakalili kwa liina laku.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Mwene akavajovela, “Namuweni Setani ihelela kuhumila kunani ngati lumuli lwa mbamba.” <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Muyuwanila! Nivapeli kuhotola kulivatila liyoka na chipilili, pamonga na kugabesa makakala goha ga likoko kawaka chindu cha kuvalemasa. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Nambu mkotoka kuheka ndava ya mizuka cheyikuvayidakila, ndi muhekelela muni mahina ginu gayandikiwi kunani kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luheku lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matei 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Lukumbi lulalula, Mpungu Msopi ammemisi Yesu luheku, akajova, nikusengusa wa Dadi, Bambu wa kunani na pamulima! Muni mambu aga uvafihiyili vevavi na luhala na vamanyaji, ubweli kuvagubukulila vana vadebe. Ena, Dadi ndi chawaganili.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>Akayendelela kujova, “Dadi wangu anipeli vindu vyoha. Avi lepi mweammanyi Mwana nga Dadi na avi lepi mweammanyi Dadi nga Mwana na yoyoha mweaganili kumgubukulila.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Kangi avang'anamkili vawuliwa vaki akalongela nawu pachiepela, “Mmotisiwa nyenye kwa kulola chenicho chemwilola! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Chakaka, nikuvajovela vamlota va Chapanga na vankosi vanogili kugawona gemukugawona nyenye aga nambu vagaweni lepi, pangi vaganili kuyuwana gemyuwana nyenye aga, nambu vayuwini lepi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa Msamaliya mweavi ana lipyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Mundu mmonga mwamanyili bwina malagizu, ayimili akamkota Yesu cha kugana kumlinga. “Muwula, nikita wuli, muni nipokela wumi wa magono goha?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yesu akamkota, “Kiki chiyandikiwi mu Malagizu ga Musa? Ukuyisoma wuli?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Mundu yula akamyangula, “Umgana Bambu Chapanga waku kwa mtima waku woha na kwa wumi waku woha na kwa makakala gaku goha na kwa luhala lwaku loha. Na, umganayi muyaku ngati cheujigana wamwene.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yesu akamjovela, “Chabwina! Kakita chenicho na veve yati wilama.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Nambu mwene aganili kulangisa kuvya amanyili cheachikotili, ndi akamkota Yesu, “Wu, muyangu ndi yani?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yesu akamyangula akajova, “Kwavi na mundu mmonga mweahelela kuhuma ku Yelusalemu kuhamba ku Yeliko, munjila vanyagaji, vakamzangila na kumtova, na vakamuhula nyula na kumnyaga vindu vyaki vyoha vyeavinavyu, vakamleka penapo avi mulung'olelu. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Na ngipu yene Mteta wa Chapanga mmonga apitayi njila yilayila, peamuweni mundu yula mweazangiwi, akaveduka kumuhana akahamba. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Mewawa mundu Mlawi mmonga, apitili penapo peamuwene mweazangiwi yula akaveduka pamuhana akahamba. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Nambu Msamaliya mmonga mweavi mulugendu ahikili peavi mundu yula ndi peamuwene akamhengela lipyana. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Akamuhegelela, akamnyala mahuta na kumsopa divayi muvilonda vyaki na kuvinyembelela bwina, kangi akamkwesa panani ya punda waki, akahamba nayu ku nyumba ya vayehe, na kumlwasa. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Chilau yaki akawusa mashonga dinali zivili akampela myimilila nyumba ya vayehe, akamjovela, mlwasa mundu uyu, na peniwuyayi yati nikukulipa chochoha cheuyonjokesa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Kangi Yesu akakota, “Pagati ya vandu vadatu ava, muyaki wa yula mweazangiwi na vanyagaji ndi yani?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Muwula wa malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa yula akamyangula “Ndi yula mweamhengili lipyana.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu akamjovela, “Uhamba ukakita mewa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvagendelela Malita na Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Yesu na vawuliwa vaki pavavi mulugendu, vakayingila muchijiji chimonga, penapo mdala mmonga mwavamkemela Malita, akavagongolela kunyumba yaki. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Malita yula, avi na mlumbu waki mwavamkemela Maliya, mwenuyo atamili papipi na Yesu na kuyuwanila malovi gaki. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Nambu Malita ajifwahisa na mahengu gamahele. Ndi, akamuhambila Yesu, akamjovela, “Bambu, nakumlola mlumbu wangu anileki mahengu aga namwene? Hinu mjovelayi anitangatilayi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Nambu Bambu akamyangula, “Malita, Malita, Veve ujifwahisa na kujing'aha na mambu gamahele. <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Nambu chiganikiwa chindu chimonga ndu. Na Maliya ahagwili lilundu labwina, na kawaka mundu wa kumnyaga.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvawula vawuliwa vaki kumuyupa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matei 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Ligono limonga, Yesu avili pandu ayupayi kwa Chapanga. Peamalili, mmonga wa vawuliwa vaki akamjovela, “Bambu, tiwulayi na tete kuyupa kwa Chapanga ngati Yohani chaavawuli vawuliwa vaki.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Yesu akavajovela. “Pemuyupa kwa Chapanga, mujova naha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Dadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Liina laku lilumbiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Unkosi waku ubwelayi.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Utipela chakulya chitu cha magono goha.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Utilekekesayi getikubudila Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">ndava muni na tete tikuvalekekesa vevakutibudila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Kotoka kutiyingisa mukulingiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Kangi akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Yani pagati yinu mweavi na nkozi, na akamhambila pagati ya kilu na kumjovela ‘Mlongo wangu, chondi niyayika mabumunda gadatu na kangi yati nikuwuyisila, <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>ndava muni nkozi wangu anihikalili kuhuma mulugendu, na nene nivii lepi na chakumpela!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Ndi yula wa mugati, ngaamyangwili, ‘Kotoka kuning'aha! Muni, nimali kudinda mlyangu, nene na vana vangu tigonili, nakuhotola kuyimuka kukupela!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Nikuvajovela yati iyimuka lepi kuhamba kumpela pamonga na kuvya nkozi waki, nambu ndava ya kukangamala kwaki kuyupa, yati iyimuka na kumpela chochoha cheigana.<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Hinu nikuvajovela, muyupa na nyenye yati mwipewa, mulonda yati mwipata, muhodisa mlyangu yati mwidinduliwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Muni mundu yeyoha mweiyupa ipewa na mweilonda ipata na mweihodesa mlyangu idinduliwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Muni yani mweavi dadi ndi mwana waki amuyupili somba wu, yati akumpela liyoka pahali pa somba? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Na ngati amuyupi likang'a yati ampela chipilili? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Hinu nyenye pamonga na uhakau winu, mumanyi kuvapela vana vinu vindu vyabwina, chakaka Dadi winu wa kunani yati ikita na pawaka, muni yati akuvapela Mpungu Msopi vala vevakumuyupa!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matei 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maluko 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Ligono limonga Yesu avi mukuuvinga mzuka wewamkitili mundu mmonga kuvya ngajova. Ndi, mzuka ukamuwuka, mundu yula akahotola kulongela, hati msambi wa vandu ukakangasa. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Nambu vandu vangi vakajova, “Ivinga mizuka kwa uhotola wa Belizebuli, mkulu wa mizuka.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Vangi vakamlinga Yesu, vakamgana, akita gachinamtiti kulangisa kuvya uhotola waki uhumili kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Nambu Yesu amanyili maholo gavi, akavajovela, Unkosi wowoha wula, weulekangini chikundi chikundi nakuhotola kusindimala, mewawa na vandu va nyumba yimonga vevalekangini yati viyaga. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Ngati Setani ana chikundi chechikomana chene kwa chene, unkosi waki yati uyima wuli? Nijova genaga ndava nyenye mukunijova nene nivinga mizuka kwa uhotola wa Belizebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Vawuliwa vinu vivinga mizuka ngati mewa chenikita nene. Ndava kyani nyenye mwijova nene nivinga mizuka kwa uhotola wa Belizebuli? Hinu venavo ndi yati vakuvahamula nyenye. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Nambu ngati nivinga mizuka kwa uhotola wa Chapanga, ndi mumanya kuvya Unkosi waki umali kuhika kwinu.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>Mundu mweavi na makakala, pailindalila nyumba yaki na vindu vya ngondo, vindu vyaki vyoha vivya bwina. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Nambu akabwelayi mundu yungi mweavi na makakala neju na kumzangila na kumnyaga vindu vyaki vya ngondo, mundu mwenuyo ihotola kuvitola vindu vyaki vyoha na kuvigavanisa.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>“Mundu yoyoha yula mwangalongosana na nene, mwenuyo isigana, na yoyoha yula mweibela kunonga pamonga na nene, mwenuyo ipechengana.”<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kwa mzuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matei 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>“Mzuka ngati uvingiwi kwa mundu, ulyungalyunga kulugangatu mukulonda pandu pa kupumulila. Ngati apapati lepi ukujijovela, ‘Yati niwuya kunyumba yangu kwenikahumili.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Peiwuya ikolela nyumba yila yitendelikiwi na vindu vivikiwi bwina. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Ndi, ihamba kuhitola mizuka hingi saba, yeyivi hihakau kuliku mwene, ndi penapo yoha yikumuyingila mundu yula. Mundu mwenuyo hinu wumi waki wivya uhakau neju, kuliku chaakavili lukumbi lwa kutumbula.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luheku lwa uchakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Paajovayi genago, mdala mmonga mweavi pagati ya msambi wa vandu akajova kwa lwami luvaha, “Limotisiwayi lileme lelikugegili na livele lelakunyong'isi!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Yesu akajova, “Vamotisiwa veviyuwana lilovi la Chapanga na kulikamula!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kugana ulangisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matei 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Msambi wa vandu pawayonjokisi, Yesu akavajovela, “Chiveleku ichi ndi chihakau, chigana ulangisu kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga, nambu yati nakupewa ulangisu wowoha manya ngawula wa Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Mewawa Yona chalolikini kuvya ulangisu kwa vandu va ku Ninawi, ndi na Mwana wa Mundu yati ivya chinamtiti kwa chiveleku ichi. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Nkosi wa chidala wa kusini yati ihumila ligono la muhalu ukulu, lukumbi lwa muhalu wa chiveleku ichi na mwene yati ijova chiveleku ichi chibudili. Muni mwene agendili kuhuma mulima wa kutali kubwela kuyuwanila malovi ga luhala ga Nkosi Solomoni, nambu penapa avi mkulu kuliku Nkosi Solomoni. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Vandu va ku Ninawi yati vihumila ligono la muhalu ukulu pamonga na vandu va chiveleku ichi yati vijova chibudili. Muni vandu va Ninawi vamuwuyalili Chapanga ndava ujumbi wa Chapanga weakokwisi Yona. Nambu penapa avi mkulu kuliku Yona!”<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli lwa higa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matei 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>“Kawaka mundu mweipambika hahi na kuyifiya amala kuyigubika na chiviga, nambu hahi ngati yipambikwi vivika kunani kuchibokoselu, muni yilangasayi bwina mugati mwoha na vandu voha veviyingila valola bwina. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Lihu laku ndi hahi ya higa yaku. Ngati lihu laku livi bwina, higa yaku yivi mulumuli. Nambu lihu laku likoywiki, higa yaku yivi mchitita. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Mujilolayi neju, lumuli lweluvi mugati yaku lukoto kuvya chitita. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Ndi, ngati higa yaku yoha una lumuli, changali pandu pangi kuvya chitita, higa yaku yati ying'asima ngati hahi cheyilangasa kwa lumuli lwaki.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvajova Vafalisayu na vawula va malagizu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matei 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maluko 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Yesu peamali kujova genago, Mfalisayu mmonga amgongolili Yesu kulya chakulya kunyumba yaki ndi Yesu akahamba kwenuko, na akatama kulya. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Mfalisayu yula akakangasa, muni amuweni Yesu asambili lepi kwakona chakulya. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Bambu akamjovela, “Nyenye Vafalisayu msanja chikombi na nkeve kuvala, nambu mugati mumemili kugana vindu vyamahele na uhakau. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Vayimu nyenye! Wu, Chapanga awumbili lepi vya kuvala, na kangi awumbili lepi vya mugati? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Nambu muvapela vangangu vyevivili mugati, munkele na muchikombi na kila chindu chivyaa chabwina kwa nyenye.”<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>“Yati muchikolela nyenye Vafalisayu, muni mkumpela Chapanga lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi za ndimbilu na libonongo na mahamba gangi ga likolo. Nambu mwileka kuvakitila vandu gegiganikiwa, na kumgana Chapanga. Yikuvagana kugakamula genago changali kukosiwa na gangi gala.”<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>“Yati muchikolela nyenye Vafalisayu, ndava mwigana kutama muvigoda vya kulongolo munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi na kujambuswa na vandu cha kugundamiliwa pavikonganika vandu. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Yati muchikolela, ndava muni muvi ngati matinda gegafiyiki na vandu vigenda panani yaki changamanya.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Mundu mmonga mweimanya malagizu akamyangula, “Muwula, malovi gaku ukutiliga na tete.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Yesu akamyangula, “Na nyenye mwemwimanya malagizu yati muchikolela! Muni mukuvagegesa vandu ndwika yeyitopa yangagegeka, na kuni mwavene nakutalambula hata lung'onji kuvatangatila. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Mwalachikolela nyenye! Muni mwijenga matinda ga vamlota va Chapanga, vavakomiwi na vagogo vinu. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Mewawa mwavene mwilangisa chakaka na kuyidakila na matendu ga vagogo vinu, muni vene vavakomili vamlota va Chapanga na nyenye mwijenga matinda gavi. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Ndava ya genago, luhala lwa Chapanga lwajovili naha, ‘Yati nivaletela vamlota na vamitumi, nambu vangi vikomiwa na vangi yati ving'ahiswa.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Ndi vandu va lukumbi ulu yati viyingila mumuhalu, ndava ya lifwa la vamlota va Chapanga voha vevakomiwi kutumbula kuwumbikiwa kwa mulima, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>kutumbula peakomiwi Abeli mbaka kukomiwa kwa Zakalia mwevamkomili pagati ya lusanja lwa luteta na pandu pamsopi. Ena chakaka, chiveleku ichi chiyingila mumuhalu ndava ya matendu genago.”<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>“Mwalachikolela nyenye mwemumanya Malagizu! Muni mufiyili fungulu wa mlyangu wa kumanya, nyenye mwavene nakuyingila, na muvabelalili vevakaliyigila vakotoka kuyingila!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Yesu pawukili penapo, Vafalisayu na vawula va malagizu kutumbula penapo vakamyomela neju na kumlinga kwa kumkota mambu gamahele, <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>Muni vagana kumkamula kwa malovi geijova.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalapisa vahomela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matei 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Msambi uvaha wa vandu wanga valangika, pavakonganiki na kutumbula kulivatilana. Yesu avajovili hoti vawuliwa vaki. “Mujiyangalila na ngemeku ya Vafalisayu ndi uhomela wavi. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Chindu chochoha chila chechigubikiwi yati chigubukuliwa na chochoha chechifiyiki yati chimanyikana. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Gala gamwajovili kuchitita, yati giyuwanika pepilangala, na chochoha chamwapwepi mumfiyu mugati kuni milyangu yidindanu, yati chikokoselewa pamulima woha.”<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wakuyogopewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matei 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>“Nikuvajovela, nyenye mwavankozi vangu, mkotoka kuvayogopa vala vevikoma higa, nambu nakuhotola kukita chindu chingi kangi. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Yati nivalangisa wa kuyogopewa, mumuyogopa Chapanga, akamala kukukoma, ihotola kumutaga mundu kumotu wa magono goha wangajimika. Nikuvajovela, mumuyogopa mwenuyo!”<verse eid="LUK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>“Yimanyikini kuvya mayeluyelu mhanu ziguliswa kwa mashonga gadebe neju, nambu kawaka hata njasi yimonga yeyikosiwa na Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Hati umahele wa mayunju ga mitu yinu zimanyikini kwa Chapanga. Mukotoka kuyogopa, nyenye mwitopela neju kuliku mayeluyelu gamahele!”<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumuyidakila amala kumubela Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matei 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>“Chakaka nikuvajovela, mundu yoyoha yula mwaakuniyidakila pavandu kuvya mwene ndi wangu, Mwana wa Mundu yati amuyidakila palongolo ya vamitumu va Chapanga kuvya mwenuyo mundu waki. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Nambu mundu yoyoha yula mwaakunibela pavandu, na Mwana wa Mundu mewawa yati akumbela palongolo ya vamitumu va Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>“Yoyoha yula mweijova lilovi la kumubelelela Mwana wa Mundu, mwenuyo yati ilekekeswa, nambu mweamliga Mpungu Msopi, yati ivya nakulekekeswa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>“Pevakuvapeleka nyenye kwa makakala, munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi, amala vahamula mihalu, amala kwa vachilongosi lenili muhamuliwa mkotoka kuvya na wogohi yati myangula kyani amala yati mujova wuli. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Muni lukumbi lulolo, Mpungu Msopi yati akuvawula gakujova.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa mundu mweavi na vindu vyamahele ahimwiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Mundu mmonga mu msambi wa vandu akamjovela Yesu, “Muwula, mjovela mlongo wangu tigavana vindu vyetihalili kwa dadi witu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Yesu akamyangula, “Nkozi wangu, yani mweaniviki nene kuhamula mihalu pagati yinu amala kuvya mtepulanisa?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Ndi, akavajovela voha, “Mujiyangalilayi na kuvya na mtima wa kugana vindu vyamahele, muni wumi wa mundu uvi lepi muvindu vyamahele vyeavi navyu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Kangi akavajovela luhumu ulu. Kwavi na mundu mmonga mweavi na vindu vyamahele, mgunda waki wapambiki mabenu gamahele. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Akaholalela mumtima waki na kujova. Hinu nikita wuli muni kawaka pandu pakuvika mabenu gangu? <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Ndi, yati nikita aga, yati nidenya chibana changu na kupamanda kangi vivaha na mwenumo yati nivika mabenu gangu goha pamonga na vindu vyangu. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Kangi nikujijovela namwene, hinu uvinavyu vindu vyabwina vyeukuvigana mumiyaka yamahele ndi upumulilayi na ulyayi na unywayi na uheka! <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Nambu Chapanga akamjovela, Uhimwiki veve, kilu ya lelu wumi waku yati utoliwa. Na vindu vyeujivikili yati vivya vya yani?<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Yesu akamalisila kujova, “Chenichi ndi cheyivya mundu mweajivikili vindu vyamahele ndava yaki mwene, nambu palongola ya Chapanga ivya mngangu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mlonda hoti Unkosi wa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matei 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Kangi Yesu akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Ndava ya genago, nikuvajovela, mkotoka kung'ahikila ndava ya chakulya chemugana muni mulamayi, amala nyula zemukuzigana ndava ya higa yinu. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Ndava muni wumi witopela kuliku chakulya, na higa yitopela kuliku nyula. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Lola makungulu, gimija lepi, wala kubena na gangali chibana. Pamonga na genago, Chapanga agalisa chakulya. Hinu nyenye mwitopela kuliku videge! <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Yani mweavi pagati yinu kwa kujing'aha ihotola kujiyonjokesala hati ligono limonga la wumi waki? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Hinu ngati, nakuhotola kuhenga chindu chidebe ngati ichi, ya kyani kujing'aha na mambu gangi? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Mugalola maluva ga mdahi chegikula, nakuhenga lihengu wala giluka lepi nyula. Nambu nikuvajovela nkosi Solomoni pamonga na kuvya na vindu vyamahele, nambu avi lepi na nyula za kunyamba ngati liluva limonga. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Hinu ngati Chapanga akuganyambisa manyahi ga kumgunda, lelu livili na chilau yaki giyochwa pamotu, wu, nakuhotola kuvawalika nyenye? Vandu mwemusadika padebe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>“Na nyenye mkotoka kuhololela neju ndava ya kung'ahikila kuvya mwilya kyani amala mwinywa kyani. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Muni vandu vangasadika va milima yingi ya pamulima uwu, vavi mukung'ahika ndava ya genago. Nambu nyenye, Dadi winu avimanyili vindu vyoha vyemugana. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Hinu, mun'gaikila kulonda hoti Unkosi wa Chapanga na genago yati mwipewa kwa kuyonjokeswa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vindu vyamahele kunani kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matei 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>“Mukotoka kuyogopa nyenye msambi udebe, muni Dadi winu aganisiwi kuvapela Unkosi waki. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Mugulisa vindu vinu, na mashonga gene muvatangatila vangangu. Mujikitila chihaku cha mashonga changalala na kijivikila vindu vinu vyabwina kunani kwa Chapanga kwangapunguka. Kwenuko vahiji nakuhegelela, wala vingokoko na kuhalibisa. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Pechivi chibana chaku ndi maholo na luhala lwa mtima waku yati uvya penapo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vavanda vevilindila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>“Mujitendekela na kuhengeka kuni, na hahi zinu ziyaka, <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>muvya ngati vavanda vavamulindila mkulu wavi mweihuma kundowa, vamudindulila mlyangu peihodesa. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Vamotiswa vavanda vala bambu wavi peuwuya akuvakolela vakona mihu! Chakaka nikuvajovela, bambu yula yati ikunga mkungi muchiwunu na kuvajovela vatama pahi pandu pakulyelela na akavahengela. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Vamotisiwa vavanda vala, hati ngati bambu wavi peiwuya pagati ya kilu amala hati hambakucha na kuvakolela vakona mihu! <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Mumanyila lijambu lenili, ngati mkolo nyumba ngamanyili lukumbi lwa muhiji kubwela, ngaatamili mihu, ngaileki lepi nyumba yaki yidenyewayi. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Mewawa na nyenye yikuvagana mujitendelekeha, ndava mwangalumanya lukumbi, Mwana wa Mundu peibwela.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mvanda msadikika na angasadikika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matei 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Petili akamkota, “Bambu, luhumu ulu ukutijovela nga tete amala ukuvajovela vandu voha?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Bambu akayangula. Ndi, yani mweavi mtumisi mbwina na analuhala? Kangi bambu waki amuviki kuvayimalila vavanda vangi na kuvapela chakulya pa lukumbi lwaki. <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Asangaluka mtumisi yula, ngati mkulu waki peiwuyayi yati amkolela ikita chenicho. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Chakaka nikuvajovela, mkulu mwenuyo yati amuvika mtumisi mwenuyo kuyimalila vindu vyaki vyoha. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Nambu muhengaji yula, ngati akujijovela mumtima waki, Mkulu wangu acheliwi kuwuya, ndi itumbula kuvatova vatumisi vayaki, vadala na vagosi, na kulya na kunywa na kugala, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>Mkulu waki yati iwuya ligono na lukumbi lwanga manyikana, yati amudumula hipandi hipandi na kumuvika lilundu limonga la vangasadika.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>Mvanda mweamanyi gala geigana bambu waki, nambu ajitendelekili lepi kuhenga genago, bambu waki akumtova neju. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Nambu mvanda mweihenga chindu changamanya gala geigana bambu waki, mwenuyo yati itoviwa padebe. Muni yula mweapewili vyamahele, mwenuyo idayiwa vyamahele na yula mweagotoliwi vyamahele neju, yati idayiwa vyamahele neju.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abwelili kuleta mpechenganu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matei 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>“Nibweli kuleta motu pamulima, ndi kuvya uvya ngaumali kuyaka!” <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Nambu nivinawu ubatizu weukunigana nibatiziwa, na nene nikuung'akila neju mbaka utimilayi! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Wu! Mwiholalela nibweli kuleta uteke pamulima? Hati padebe, lepi, utekee nambu mpechenganu. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Kutumbula hinu vandu mhanu va nyumba yimonga yati vipechengana upandi vadatu na upandi wungi vavili, na kangi upandi vavili na upandi wungi vadatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Yati vipechengana dadi na msongolo waki, msongolo na dadi waki, mau na msikana waki, msikana na nyina waki, nayala na mkamwana waki, mkamwana na nayala waki.<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulumanya lukumbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matei 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Yesu akaujovela msambi wa vandu, “Pemukugawona mahundi gihumalila kwelitipama lilanga, bahapo mwijova, yati yitonya fula, na chakaka fula yitonya. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Na pemwilola mpungu upuganisa kuhuma kuupandi wa kusini mujova, lelu yati livya lilanga, Chakaka kwivya na lilanga lachona. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Vahomela nyenye! Mumanyili kulotela mambu ga lusenje, kwa kulola chekuvi lelu kwa kulola mulima na mahundi, ndava kyani mwihotola lepi kumanya mambu ga lusenje lwa hinu?”<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tepulanayi na likoko waku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matei 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>“Ndava kyani mwavene mwihotola lepi kuhagula mambu gabwina ga kukita? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Ngati mundu mweakutakili, akukupeleka palibanji la mihalu, mbanga mutepulana mwakona munjila muni akotoka kukupeleka kwa mhamula mihalu, namwene akugotola kwa manjolinjoli na vene vakusopa muchifungu. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Chakaka yati wihuma lepi muchifungu, mbaka peumalakisa kulipa sendi ya lishonga la mwishu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Mumuwuyila Chapanga amala mwifwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Lukumbi lwenulo vandu nunuyo, vabweli kumjovela Yesu, mambu ga vandu va ku Galilaya, vevakomiwa na Pilatu, lukumbi vihinja mifuya yavi ndava ya luteta. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Yesu akavayangula, “Ndava Vagalilaya vala vevakomiwi kwa njila yila mwihololela kuvya Vagalilaya vala, vambudili Chapanga kuliku Vagalilaya vangi, hati gavakolili mambu genago? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Chakaka nikuvajovela, lepi, changamuwuyila Chapanga winu, na nyenye yati mwifwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Amala, kumi na nane vala, vevagwiliwi na mnala kuchijiji cha ku Siloamu, vafwili, ndi mwiholalela kuvya venavo, vahokili kuliku vandu voha vevatama ku Yelusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Chakaka nikuvajovela, lepi, nambu na nyenye changamuwuyila Chapanga, na nyenye mewawa yati mwifwa.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu Lwa mkongo wa mtini wangapambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Kangi Yesu akavajovela luhumu ulu, “Mundu mmonga avi na mkongo wa mtini mumgunda waki wa mizabubu, mundu mwenuyo akahamba kuyava matunda mumkongo wula, nambu apatili lepi. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Ndi akamjovela mhenga lihengu wa mgunda, ‘Lola! Mumiyaka yidatu nakalibwela kuyava matunda mumkongo uwu wa mtini, nambu kawaka chindu chenigana. Hinu uhudumula! Ndava kyani ulalisa mgunda wangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Nambu mhenga lihengu akamyangula, Bambu, ‘Tiuleka kavili namwaka, na nene yati niukulugila na kusopalela mabuli. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Ngati upambiki matunda kumwaka chabwina, ngati nakupambika, ndi udumulayi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amulamisa mdala Ligono la Kupumulila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Ligono limonga la Kupumulila, Yesu avi mukuwula munyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Pavi na mdala mmonga mweavi na mzuka, mwealwalayi lukumbi lwa miyaka kumi na nane, mdala mwenuyo avi na chipindi ndi nakuhotola kuyima. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Yesu peamuweni akamkemela na kumjovela, “Mau, ulekekiswi utamu waku!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Yesu akamuvikila mawoko mdala yula na bahapo higa yaki yikagoloseka, na akatumbula akamlumbalila Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Mkulu wa nyumba ya kukonganekela Vayawudi akayoma, ndava Yesu amulamisi mdala yula, Ligono la Kupumulila. Ndi akavajovela vandu vavavi penapo, “Muvi nagu magono sita gakuhenga mahengu. Hinu mubwela magono genago kulamisiwa utamu winu, nambu lepi kulamiswa Ligono la Kupumulila!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Nambu Bambu akamyangula, “Vahomela nyenye! Yani mweavi pagati yinu mwangawopola ng'ombi yaki amala lipunda laki muchivaya na kuyipeleka kunywiha manji Ligono la Kupumulila. <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Mdala yula avi wa chiveleku cha Ibulahimu, nambu Setani amkungili miyaka kumi na nane wu, chabwina lepi kumdindulila vifungu vyaki Ligono la Kupumulila?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Yesu peamali kujova genago, makoko gaki vakoli soni, nambu vandu vangi voha vakaheka kwa mambu gakukangasa gahengili.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu wa mbeyu yidebe ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matei 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maluko 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Yesu akavakota, “Unkosi wa Chapanga uwanangini na kiki? Wu, nikuwanangisa na kyani? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Ngati mbeyu ya mkongo wa haladali yeyitoliwi na mundu mmonga na kuhilalila mumgunda waki. Yikamela na kuvya mkongo, na videge vikajenga hisakanilu mumambanda gaki.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu wa ngemeku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matei 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Yesu akakota kavili, “Unkosi wa Chapanga nikuwanangisa na kyani? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Ngati ngemeku laatoli mdala mmonga na kuhangisana na uhembe madebe gavili na woha watutumwiki.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mlyangu udebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matei 7:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Yesu paayendelela na lugendu lwaki kuhamba ku Yelusalemu apitayi mumiji na muhijiji, kuni avawulayi vandu.<verse eid="LUK 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Mundu mmonga akamkota Yesu, “Bambu, wu, vandu vevisanguliwa ngavamahele?” <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>Yesu akavajovela, “Mukangamala neju kuyingila mumlyangu udebedebe, muni nikuvajovela vandu vamahele yati vilinga kuyingila nambu nakuhotola. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Lukumbi lubwela lwa mkolo nyumba kuyima na kudinda mlyangu. Ndi penapo yati muyima kuvala na kutumbula kuhodesa mlyangu kwa kujova, ‘Bambu utidindulilayi mlyangu!’ Nambu mwene yati akuvayangula, ‘Nakuvamanya nyenye wala nakumanya kwemwihuma!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Na nyenye yati mwitumbula kumjovela, ‘Tete ndi vala vetalili na kunywelela na veve, mewa veve watiwulili hotohoto muhijiji yitu!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Nambu mwene yati ijova, ‘Nakuvamanya nyenye wala kwemwihuma. Muwuka palongolo yangu, mwavoha nyenye vahenga gahakau!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Ndi yati mwivembeneka na kuyaga minu, lukumbi pemkuvalola Ibulahimu na Izaki na Yakobo na vamlota voha va Chapanga vavi Muunkosi wa Chapanga, nambu nyenye muvi kuvala! <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Vandu yati vibwela kuhuma pandi zoha za mulima, na kulya pamonga Muunkosi wa Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Ndi vala vevavi va mwishu yati vivya va kutumbula na vala vevavi va kutumbula yati vivya va mwishu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuyivembela Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matei 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Lukumbi lwenulo Vafalisayu vangi vamhambili Yesu na kumjovela, “Uwuka penapa uhamba pandu pangi muni Nkosi Helodi igana kukukoma.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Yesu akavayangula, “Muhamba mukamjovela lihogo, ‘Lelu na chilau nivinga mizuka na kuvalamisa vatamu na pamalau yati nimalakisa lihengu langu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Nambu yikunigana niyendelela na lugendu lwangu, lelu na chilau na pamalau, muni yihotoleka lepi mlota wa Chapanga, kukomiwa kuvala ya Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>“Wa Yelusalemu! Veve Yelusalemu! Mweukuvakoma vamlota va Chapanga, vevatumwili kwaku. Kwa kuvatova na maganga. Pamahele niganili kuvahegelesa vana vaku pamonga ngati nguku, cheyiyuvatila tuvana twaki mumagwaba, nambu mwaganili lepi. <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Lola! Nyenye yati mulekewa muji winu. Na nene nikuvajovela yati nakunilola kavili mbaka lukumbi pa mwijova, Amotisiwa mweibwela kwa uhotola wa Bambu.”<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu amlamisa mundu mweavi na utamu wa kuhimba higa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Ligono Limonga la Kupumulila, Yesu ahambili kulya chakulya, kunyumba ya chilongosi mmonga wa Vafalisayu, na vandu vakavya kumlingulila. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Palongolo ya Yesu avi mundu mweavi na utamu wa kuhimba higa <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yesu akavakota vawula va malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa na Vafalisayu, “Wu, mhilu wijova wuli, chabwina amala chabwina lepi, kumlamisa mundu Ligono la Kupumulila?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Nambu vene vakaguna. Yesu akamtola mundu yula na kumlamisa, akamleka ahambayi. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Kangi akavajovela, “Yani pagati yinu mweavi na mwana waki amala ng'ombi yaki yeyidumbukili muchiliva nakuyihumisa bahapo, ndava mu Ligono la Kupumulila?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Nambu vene nakuhotola kumyangula.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwusa na kunyenyekela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Yesu akavalola vavagongoliwi chavajihagulila vigoda vya palongolo, ndi akavajovela, <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>“Ngati mundu akugongolili, kundowa ukotoka kutama pavigoda vya palongolo, Pangi agongoliwi yungi mkulu kuliku veve. <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>Mweavagongolili mwavoha nyenye vavili, yati ibwela na kukujovela, ‘Uwuka atama uyu.’ Penapo yati wikola soni na kuhamba kutama pandu pa mwishu. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Ngati mundu akugongolili kundowa, veve uhamba ukatama muvigoda vya mumbele, muni mweakugongolili yula, paibwela yati akukujovela, ‘Wankozi wangu yima ubwela utama pa vigoda vya palongolo.’ Penapo yati utopela pavandu voha, vevatamili pamonga na veve. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Muni mundu yoyoha mweakujikwiha yati iheleswa, na yeyoha mweakujihelesa yati ikwihiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Kangi akamjovela mwaigongolela yula, “Ngati uvatendelekili vandu chakulya cha muhi amala kimihi, kotoka kuvagongolela vankozi vaku amala valongo vaku amala veutamanila nawu papipi vevavi na vindu vyamahele, muni na vene vihotola kukugongolela ndava na kukuwuyisila chewavahengili. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Nambu peundelekela chakulya cha mselebuko, vagongolela vangangu na vevagogodili higa vangagenda na vangalola, <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>na veve yati umotisiwa muni uvagongolili vangahotola kukuwuyisila. Nambu Chapanga yati akuwuyisila gabwina mu ligono la kuyukiswa vandu vabwina.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu wa mselebuko uvaha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matei 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Mmonga wa vala vavatamili na Yesu pameza, akajova amotisiwa mundu yula mweibwela kuyla chakulya cha mselebuko Muunkosi wa Chapanga!<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Yesu akamjovela, “Mundu mmonga atendekili mselebuko uvaha, na kuvagongolela vandu vamahele. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Palwahiki lukumbi lwa kulya, amtumili mvanda waki akavakemela vevagongoliwi, ‘Mbwela, kila chindu chitendelekiwi!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Nambu voha, mmonga na kugelekela yungi vakutumbula kujova chondi pepayi. Mundu wa kutumbula akamjovela, mvanda yula, ‘Niguli mgunda yikunigana nihamba nikaulola pepayi yati nibwela lepi.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Na yungi akajova, ‘Niguli ng'ombi kumi za kulimila nihamba kuzilinga kulima chondi unilekekesa.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Na yungi akajova, ‘Nigegili mdala ndava ya genago, nakuhotola kubwela.’”<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>“Mtumisi yula akawuya na kumjovela bambu waki mambu goha. Mkolo nyumba yula akayoma na kumlagiza mvanda waki, ‘Kita kanyata uhamba munjila yivaha na tunjila twa muji ukavaleta vangangu na vangagenda na vangalola na vevagogodili higa.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Mtumisi yula Paawuyili kuhuma kweatumiwili akamjovela, ‘Bambu, goha geukalagizi gahengiki, nambu pakona pandu pakutama vandu.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Bambu yula akamjovela mvanda. Uhamba munjila yivaha na tunjila twa muji, ukavakamula vandu kuyingila munyumba yangu yimema. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Nikuvajovela nyenye, voha vevatumbwili kugongolewa, kawaka hati mmonga, mweimywanga chakulya cha mselebuko wangu!”<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chechiganikwa kuvya mulanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matei 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Msambi wa vandu walongosini na Yesu, mwene akang'anamuka na kuvajovela, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>Mundu yoyoha mweibwela kwa nene yikumgana aniganayi neju nene, kuliku kumgana dadi waki na nyina waki na mdala waki na vana vaki na valongo vaki na valumbu vaki, pamonga na wumi waki, changakita ago, nakuhotola kuvya muwuliwa wangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Mundu yoyoha yula mwangagega msalaba waki na kunilanda mwenuyo nakuhotola kuvya muwuliwa wangu.<verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Wu, yani pagati yinu mweigana kujenga mnala nakutama hoti pahi, kuvalanga mashonga kumanya ngati avi nagu gegitosha kumalakisa kujenga? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Ngati lepi, akatumbula kujenga mkingisa, nakuhotola kumalakisa vandu voha vevilola yati vakumuheka. <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>Yati vijova, Mundu uyu atumbwili kujenga. Nambu nakuhotola kumalakisila!<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>“Wu, Nkosi yani mweigana kuhamba kutovana ngondo na Nkosi yungi, nakutama hoti pahi na kuhololela, wu, ihotola kwa manjolinjoli waki elufu kumi, kutovana ngondo na nkosi yula mweibwela kutovana nayu ngondo mweavi na manjolinjoli elufu ishilini? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Ngati amanyili kuvya nakuhotola, yati avatuma vajumbi kuyupa vakotoka kutova, lukumbi nkosi yungi akona kutali. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Mewawa,” Kawaka mundu mweihotola kuvya muwuliwa wangu, changaleka vindu vyoha vye avi navyu.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwinyu wangali lihengu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matei 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maluko 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>“Mwinyu chindu cha bwina, nambu mwinyu ngati uyagisi lunyong'onyo lwaki, yati usopewa kyani mbaka kuvya kavili mwinyu? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Yabwina lepi kusopewa muludaka amala mabuli. Vandu vakuyitaga kuvala. Mundu mweavi na makutu na ayuwana!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa limbelele leliyagili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matei 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Ligono limonga vatola kodi na vevambudila Chapanga vamahele vahambili kumuyuwanila Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Vafalisayu na vawula va malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa vakatumbula kung'ung'uta, “Mumlola mundu mwenuyu, akuvakemela vandu vevambudila Chapanga na kavili ilya nawu!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Yesu akavajovela luhumu ulu, <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>“Ngati mmonga winu avi na mambelele, miya yimonga na akamanya kuvya mmonga pagati yavi ayagili, yati ikita kyani? Yati akugaleka mambelele tisini na tisa gala kulugangatu na kuhamba kulonda yila yeyiyagili mbaka ampatayi. <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Ngati amuwona yati akuyigega mumavega kwa luheku. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>Peihika panyumba, Yati akuvakemela vamukozi vaki na veitama nawu papipi na kuvajovela, ‘Tivyai na luheku pamonga na nene ndava niliweni limbelele langu lelayagili.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Mewawa nikuvajovela, yati kwivya na luheku kunani kwa Chapanga, mundu mmonga mweakumbudila Chapanga, paileka kubuda, kuliku vandu tisini na tisa vabwina na viganikwa lepi kumuwuyila Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa lishonga leliyagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>“Amala mdala yoki mweavi na mashonga kumi, limonga likamyaga, yati ikita wuli? Nakupambika hahi, na kutyanyila nyumba na kuilonda neju mbaka ayilola? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Akamala kuipata, akuvakemela vankozi vaki na veitama nawu papipi na kuvajovela, ‘Mvya na luheku pamonga na nene muni nilipatili lishonga langu lelayagili!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Mewawa nikuvajovela, ndi chavivya na luheku vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga, ndava ya mundu mmonga mweambudili Chapanga, paileka kubudila Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana mweayagili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Yesu akayendelela kujova. Kwavili na mundu mmonga mweavi na vana vasongolo vavili. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Mdebe yula akamjovela dadi waki, Dadi, nipelayi uhali wa vindu vyeviganikiwa kupewa, Dadi waki akavagavanisila vindu vyaki. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Gapitili lepi Magono gamahele, mwana mdebe yula akagulisa vindu vyaki vyoha, na kuwuka na mashonga geapewili, akahamba kumulima wa kutali, kwenuko akazipomondana kwa mambu ga ukemi mashonga gala. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Peamalili kila chindu cheavili nachu, ndi yikahumila njala yivaha pamulima wenuwo na mwene akatumbula kung'ahika. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Akahamba kwa mkolonjinji mmonga, wa mulima wenuwo na kuyupa lihengu, mwene akampela lihengu la kudima maguluvi kumgunda waki. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Anogili kulya chakulya cha maguluvi gala, nambu kawaka mundu mweampeli chindu cha kulya. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Mumbele luhala lwamuyili akajova mumtima waki. Kuvi na vana lihengu, valinga kwa Dadi wangu, vevilya na kusigalisa chakulya na nene nifwa penapa na njala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Yati niwuya kwa dadi wangu na kumjovela, Dadi, nimbudili Chapanga na nikubudili veve mewa. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>Niganikiwa lepi kavili kukemelewa, mwana waku, unikita ngati mmonga wa vana lihengu vaku. <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Ndi akatumbula lugendu kuwuya kwa dadi waki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Mwene peavili cha kutali, dadi waki amuweni, kwa mtima wa lipyana amjumbalili na kumjambusa cha uganu. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Mwana yula akamjovela, ‘Dadi, nimbudili Chapanga, na nikubudili veve mewa. Nene niganikiwa lepi kavili kukemelewa mwana waku.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Nambu dadi waki akavajovela vanalihengu vaki, ‘Kanyata!’ Muleta nyula yabwina mumuwalika. Mumuwalika na pete pamonga na champali! <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Mukatola mpapakasi wa mweakulupi mukahinja, tilyayi na kuselebuka! <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Ndava muni mwana vangu uyu kwa nene avi ngati afwili, nambu hinu akona mumi, ayagili hinu awonikini. Vakatumbula kuselebuka.”<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>“Lukumbi lwenulo muhaja waki avi akona kumgunda. Ndi peawuyayi kuhegelela panyumba, akayuwana vilulu na vandu vikina ng'oma. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Akamkemela mmonga wa mtumisi kumkota, ‘Chivii kyani kwenuko?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Mtumisi yula akayangula, ‘Mlongo waku awuyili kunyumba, na dadi waku amuhinjili mpapakasi mweakulupili, muni ampatili akona mumi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>“Nambu mvaha yula akavya na ligoga na kubela kuyingila mugati. Ndi dadi waki akahuma kuvala na kumuyupa neju ayingila mugati. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Nambu mwene akamyangula dadi waki, ‘Lola, Nikuhengili mahengu Miyaka yoha iyi ngati mvanda changabela malagizu gaku hati padebe. Unipeli kyani? Unipeli lepi hati kamene kadebe na nene nganiselebwiki na vankozi vangu. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Nambu mwana waku uyu mwepomondini mashonga gaku pamonga na vakemi, peabweli umuhinji mpapakasi mweakulupili!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Dadi waki akamyangula, ‘Mwana vangu, veve uvi pamonga na nene magono goha na vindu vyoha vyenivi navyu vyaku. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Nambu yatiganili kukita mselebuko na luheku ndava mlongo waku mweavi ngati afwili, hinu akona mumi, mweayagili nambu hinu awonikini.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Muyimalila lihengu mwaachenjili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Yesu akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Mundu mmonga mweavi na vindu vyamahele, avi na mundu wa kuyimilila lihengu laki. Mkolo vindu ayuwini kuvya myimilila lihengu yula ipomondana vindu. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Mkolo vindu, akamkemela myimila lihengu yula na kumkota, ‘kyani cheniyuwana? Nigana univalangila vindu vyoha, muni nakuhotola kuyimalila lihengu langu kavili.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Myimalila lihengu yula akahololela mumtima waki, ‘Bambu wangu igana kunivinga lihengu, yati nikita kyani? Makakala ga kulima nakuhotola na kuhamba kuyupayupa ngati namngangu niwona soni. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Hinu nimanyili chakukita, muni penivingiwayi lihengu, muni vandu vanikemelayi kunyumba zavi.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>“Akavakemela voha vevidayiwa vindu na bambu waki, mmonga mmonga akatumbula kumkota yula wa kutumbula. ‘Udayiwa vindu vilinga na bambu wangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Mwene akamyangula. ‘Makalangi kumi na mcheche ga mahuta ya mizeituni,’ Ndi myimalila lihengu yula akajova, ‘Tola balua laku lewidayiwa, tama kanyata, yandika saba.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Kangi akamkota yungi, ‘Veve wakalidayiwa vindu vilinga?’ Akayangula, ‘Magunila ga nganu miya yimonga.’ Muyimilila lihengu yula akamjovela. ‘Tola balua laku la gewidayiwa Yandika semanini.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>“Bambu yula akamulumba myimila lihengu mwachenjili yula, muni ahengili kwa luhala. Ndava vandu va mulima uwu vana luhala neju pevihenga vindu na vandu ngati avo, kuliku vandu vevavi munkosi wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Yesu akayendelela kujova, “Nikuvajovela nyenye, mjipatila vankozi kuhuma mumashonga na vindu vya pamulima uwu, muni pevimalika, vavakemela mumatamilu gavi ga magono goha. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Mundu yoyoha mwaisadikiwa muvindu videbe, mewa yati isadikiwa muvindu vyamahele. Na yoyoha angasadikiwa muvindu videbe isadikiwa lepi muvindu vyamahele. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Ngati nyenye mwisadikiwa lepi mumashonga na vindu vya pamulima, ndi yani akuvagotolela na vindu vya uchakaka? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Ngati nakuhotola kusadikiwa mumashonga na muvindu vya mundu yungi, yani mweihotola kuvagotolela vindu vinu mwavene?”<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>“Kawaka mvanda mweihotola kuvahengela vabambu vavili, muni yati amgana mmonga na kumhakalila yungi, amala yati ilongosana na mmonga na kumuvevesa yungi. Mwihotola lepi kumuhengela Chapanga na mashonga.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malovi gangi ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matei 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maluko 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Vafalisayu pevayuwini genago, vakamvevesa Yesu, ndava vene vavi vandu vakugana mashonga, <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Yesu akavajovela, “Nyenye mujilola mwavabwina palongolo ya vandu, nambu Chapanga ayimanyili mitima yinu. Ndava chindu chechilolekana chabwina neju palongo ya vandu, kwa Chapanga chilolekana chihakau.”<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>“Malagizu ga Chapanga geampelii Musa na mayandiku ga valota va Chapanga gakokwiswi mbaka lukumbi lwa Yohani wa Kubatiza. Kutumbula penapo, Lilovi la Bwina la Unkosi wa Chapanga ukokoswa, na kila mundu iyingila kwa makakala. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Nambu yiyeywa neju kunani kwa Chapanga na mulima kuyaga kuliku kayandiku kadebe kuhunguliwa mu Malagizu ga Musa.”<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>“Mundu yoyoha mweakumuleka mdala waki na kugega yungi, mwenuyo ikita ugoni na mundu yoyoha mwaakumgega, mdala mwaalekiwi yula.” Namwene mewa ikita ugoni.<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mkolo vindu vyamahele na Lazalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>“Kwavili na mundu mmonga mweavi na vindu vyamahele, mwaawala nyula zezaguliwa kwa mashonga gamahele na nyula zezing'asima na kulya vindu vyabwina magono goha.” <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Na pamlyangu uvaha wa mundu mwenuyo, vavi kumvika mundu mmonga mngangu, liina laki Lazalu, mweavi na vilonda vyamahele. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Mngangu mwenuyo, anogela kupewa vyakulya vevyagwayi pahi kuhuma pameza ya mkolo vindu vyamahele yula. Hati mabwa gabwela na kumihyanga vilonda vyaki.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Lwakabwela lukumbi Lazalu yula afwili na vamitumu va kunani vakamtola na kumuvika papipi ya Ibulahimu. Na mkolo vindu vyamahele mewa afwili vakamzika. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Mkolo vindu vya mahele yula, paavi mukung'ahika neju kuligodi litali langali mwishu, akamlola Ibulahimu cha kutali na Lazalu papipi yaki. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Ndi akamkemela. Dadi, Ibulahimu! Nihengela lipyana, umtuma Lazalu ajwisa lung'onji lwaki mumanji na kunipolesa lulimi lwangu, muni ning'ahika neju mumotu uwu!<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>“Nambu Ibulahimu akamyangula, mwana vangu. Holalela, wapokili vindu vyabwina pawavi muwumi waku, na Lazalu opokili vindu vihakau. Hinu Lazalu ipumuliswa, na veve uvi mumang'ahiso. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Pamonga na genago, pagati ya nyenye na tete, kuvili na ligodi livaha, muni vevigana kubwela kwa nyenye nakuhotola, na vevigana kuwuka kwa nyenye kubwela kwa tete nakuhotola, <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Mkolo vindu vyamahele yula akajova, ‘Hinu Dadi Ibulahimu nikuyupa umtuma Lazalu ahamba kunyumba ya valongo vangu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>muni nivii nawu valongo mhanu, ahamba akavajovela vajiyangalila vakotoka navene vakotoka kubwela kumang'ahiso kuni.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>“Ibulahimu akamjovela, kwenuko ‘Valongo vaku vavi na mayandiku ga Musa na vamlota va Chapanga, valeka, vavayuwanila venavo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Mkolo vindu vyamahele yula akajova kavili, ‘Lepi dadi Ibulahimu! Nambu ngati avahambalili mundu mweayukili kuhuma kwa vafwili, yati vileka kubuda kwavi.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Ibulahimu akajova, ‘Ngati nakuvayuwanila mayandiku ga Musa na vamlota va Chapanga, nakumyuwanila mundu yoyoha hati ngati ayukili kuhuma kwe vevafwili.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Kumbudila Chapanga na kulekekesewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matei 18:6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maluko 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Yesu akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Nakuhotola mambu ga kuvakita vandu vambudila Chapanga gakotoka kuhumila, nambu alachikolela mundu yula mweikita genago gahumila.” <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Ngayivii mbanga mundu mwenuyo, kukungiwa livala livaha la kuyagila musingu na kujwigiswa munyanja, kuliku kumyokisa mmonga wa vadebe ava.<verse eid="LUK 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Mujiyangalila! Ngati mlongo waku akuhokili, mywangila, akakukamula chigendelu umulekesayi. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Hati ngati akuhokili mala saba kwa ligono limonga, na kukuwuyila mala saba. Kukukamula chigendelu, umulekesayi.<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sadika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Vamitumi vakamjovela Bambu Yesu, “Utiyonjakesa kusadika.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Ndi Bambu akayangula, “Kusadika kwinu ngakuvi kudebe ngati lumbeyu ulu lwa haladali, ngamuhotwili kuujovela mkongo wa mkuyu, ‘Jitupula na ukajimelesa munyanja.’ Na wene ngauvayidakili.”<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengu ga mvanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>“Tijova mmonga winu, ana mvanda wa lihengu kumgunda, amala kudima mambelele. Mvanda yula peiwuya kuhuma kulihengu, Wu, ijoviwa na mkulu waki, ‘Bwela kanyata utama ulyayi chakulya?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Lepi! Nambu yati akumjovela, ‘Nitendelekela chakulya na kunihengela mbaka penimala kulya na kuywelela, ndi na veve pewilya na kunywelela.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Wu, mkulu yula yati amsengusa mtumisi yula ndava akitili goha geamlagazili? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Na nyenye mewawa, mukahengayi kila chindu chemulagizwi kuhenga, mujovayi, ‘Tete vavanda tihengili lihengu litu ndu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvalamisa vanamabudi kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Yesu peavi mulugendu kuhamba ku Yelusalemu, akapitila mumbaka ya Samaliya na Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Peayingili muchijiji chimonga vandu kumi vevavi na mabudi vakambwelela. Vakayima cha patali. <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>Vakajova kwa lwami luvaha, “Yesu! Bambu! Utihengela lipyana!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Yesu peavaweni akavajovela, “Muhamba mukajilangisa kwa vakuteta va Chapanga.” Ndi pevavi mukuhamba vakanyamba. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Mmonga wavi peajimanyi kuvya alamiswi, awuyili kuni akumlumbalila Chapanga kwa lwami luvaha. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Akamfugamila Yesu mumagendelu na kumsengusa. Mundu mwenuyo avi Msamaliya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Nambu Yesu akakota, “Wu, vavi lepi vandu kumi vevanyambisiwi? Vangi tisa vala vavi koki? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Hinu kawaka vandu vangi vevawuyi kumsengusa Chapanga ndi ngayuyu myehe?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Penapo akamjovela mundu mwenuyo, “Yima uhamba, kusadika kwaku kukulamisi.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela kwa Unkosi wa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matei 24:23-28</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Vafalisayu vamkoti Yesu kuvya Unkosi wa Chapanga yati ubwela ndali. Mwene akavayangula, “Unkosi wa Chapanga yati ubwela lepi cha kulolekana. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Kawaka mundu mweihotola kujova, ‘Uvi kuni, amala uvi kula!’ Muni unkosi wa Chapanga uvi pagati yinu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Kangi akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Galabwela magono yati mwinogela kuliwona ligono limonga mumagono gaki Mwana wa Mundu, nambu yati nakuyiwona. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Vandu yati vakuvajovela, ‘Lola, avi kula!’ Amala ‘Lola, avi kuni!’ Nambu nyenye mukoto kuwuka wala kuvalanda. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Muni yati yivya ngati mbamba cheyimwetula chigafula kuhumila upandi umonga mbaka wungi, ndi yati cheivya ligono la kubwela kwaki Mwana wa Mundu. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Nambu yikumgana hoti, kung'ahika neju na kubelelewa na vandu va chiveleku ichi. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Ngati chayavili lusenje lwa Nuhu, ndi cheyibwela kuvya magono ga kuwuya kwaki Mwana wa Mundu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Vandu vayendalili kulya na kuywelela, kugega na kugegewa mbaka Nuhu peayingili muwatu uvaha. Fula yivaha yatonyili na manji gakamema na kuvakoma vandu voha. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Mewawa ngati cheyavili magono ga Lutu. Vandu vayendalili kulya na kuywelela, kugula na kugulisa, kuhila mbeyu na kujenga nyumba. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>Nambu ligono Lutu paawukili ku Sodoma, motu na chibiliti vyatonyili ngati fula kuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga na kuvakoma voha. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Mewawa ndi cheyivya ligono la Mwana wa Mundu peiwuya.”<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>“Ligono lenilo, mundu yoyoha mweivya kuvala ya nyumba akotoka kuyingila munyumba yaki kutola vindu vyaki, mewawa na yoyoha mweavikumgunda akotoka kuwuya mumbele. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Muhololela gegamkolili mdala wa Lutu! <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Mundu Yoyoha mweigana kuusangula wumi waki, yati auyagisa na mundu yoyoha mweakuyagisa wumi waki yati akuugombola. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Nikuvajovela kilu ya ligono lenilo, vandu vavili vevagonili pamonga palusongwani, mmonga yati itoliwa na yungi yati ilekewa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Kangi vadala vavili yati vivya pamonga mukuyaga mbeyu, mmonga yati itolewa na yungi yati ilekewa.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>Vandu vavili yati vivya kumgunda mmonga yati itoliwa na yungi yati ilekewa.<verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Penapo vakamkota, “Koki Bambu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Mwene akavayangula, “Pewivya mtuhi, ndi pevikonganekela manditi.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Luhumu wa lipwela na mhamula mihalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Kangi Yesu akavajovela, luhumu yikuvagana kuyupa magono goha changali kukotoka. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Akajova, “Kwavili na mhamula mihalu kumuji wenuwo iyupa lepi kwa Chapanga wala nakuvahengela vandu bwina. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Mumuji wenuwo, pavi na lipwela mmonga, mweamhambila mhamula mihalu ligono kwa ligono, amkengelela kwa kuhamula bwina apatayi vindu vyaki kuhuma kwa likoko waki. <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Kwa magono gamahele Mhamula mihalu yula akabela kumkengelela, nambu pamwishu akahololela mumtima waki, ‘Pamonga na nene niyupa lepi kwa Chapanga wala kuvahengela vandu bwina, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>Nambu ndava ya lipwela uyu akuning'aha yati nikumkengelela kuhamula bwina, ngati lepi, yati iyendelela kunibwelela, na pamwishu yati akunitotokeha!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Bambu akajova, “Myuwanila cheijova muhamula mihalu mhakau. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Kujova Chapanga yati akuvakengelela lepi vandu veavahagwili, vevakumvembela muhi na kilu? Wu, yati ikavila kuvayuwanila? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Nikuvajovela, yati akuvakengelela kanyata. Pamonga na genago, Wu, yati kwivya na sadika pamulima lukumbi peibwela Mwana wa Mundu?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa Mfalisayu na mtola kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Kangi Yesu akavajovela luhumu wa vandu vala vevakujilola vabwina na kuvavesa vangi. <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>“Vandu vavili vahambili ku Nyumba ya Chapanga kumuyupa. Mmonga Mfalisayu na yungi mtola kodi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Mfalisayu yula akayima, kuyupa kwa Chapanga chakumtima akajova, Veve Chapanga, nikusengusa ndava muni nene nivii lepi ngati vandu vangi, vanyagaji na vivikita gahakau na vevikita ugoni. Nikusengusa ndava muni nene nivii lepi ngati mtola kodi uyu. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Nikujiinisa chakulya ndava ya Chapanga mala zivili kwa lijuma, niwusa lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi muvindu vyangu.<verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Nambu mtola kodi yula, ayimili cha kutali, changali hati kulolokesa mihu kunani kwa Chapanga ndi ajitovili nganga cha ngolongondi, akajova. Chapanga veve, unihengala lipyana nene mwenikubudili! <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Yesu akavajovela, mtola kodi yula awuyili kunyumba kuni ayidakiliwi na Chapanga. Nambu Mfalisayu yula lepi, ndava muni kila mundu mweakujikwiha yati iheleswa na kila mundu mweakujihelesa yati ikwihiwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvamotisa vana vadebe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matei 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maluko 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Vandu vangi vamletili Yesu vana vadebe muni avavikila mawoko na kuvamotisa. Vawuliwa vaki pevavawene vakavaywangila. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Nambu Yesu akavakemela na kujova, “Muvaleka vana vedebe vabwela kwangu, wala mkoto kuvabesa, muni unkosi wa Chapanga ndava ya vandu ngati venava. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Chakaka nikuvajovela, mundu yoyoha mwanga upokela Unkosi wa Chapanga ngati mwana mdebe, yati iyingila lepi muunkosi wenuwo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mkolo vindu vyamahele chilongosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matei 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maluko 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Mkolo vindu vyamahele mmonga Myawudi, amkotili Yesu, “Muwula mbwina, nikita wuli muni nipokela wumi wa magono goha?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yesu akamjovela, “Ndava kyani ukunikemela mbwina? Kawaka mweavimbwina nga Chapanga mwene. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Uyimanya mihilu ya Chapanga, ukoto kukita ugoni na ukoto kukoma na ukoto kuyiva na ukoto kujova ga udese vakitila gabwina dadi na nyina waku.”<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Mwene akajova, “Genago goha nigakamwili kutumbula uwana wangu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yesu peayuwini, akamjovela, “Yikugana wakona kukita chindu chimonga, gulisa kila chindu cheuvi nachu, vapela vangangu mashonga ago, ndi veve yati ukujivikila vindu vyaku kunani kwa Chapanga, kangi bwela unilandayi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Nambu mundu mwenuyo peayuwini genago, akavya ngolongondi neju ndava avi na vindu vyamahele.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yesu peamuwene mundu mwenuyu avi ngolongondi akajova, “Yinonopa neju kwa vakolo vindu vyamahele kuyingila mu Unkosi wa Chapanga! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Muni yiyuyuka kwa hinyama yeyikemiwa ngamiya kuholota palibowo la sindanu, kuliku mweavi na vindu vyamahele kuyingila Muunkosi wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Vandu vevayuwini ago, vakakota, “Yani hinu, mweisanguliwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yesu akayangula, “Gangahotoleka kwa vandu, kwa Chapanga gihotoleka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Kangi Petili akamkota, “Na tete wuli? Tuvilekili vindu vyoha na kukulanda.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Yesu akavajovela, “Chakaka nikuvajovela, mundu yoyoha mwaileki nyumba amala mdala waki amala mlongo amala dadi na nyina waki amala vana vaki ndava ya unkosi wa Chapanga, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>Yati ipokela gamahele neju mulukumbi ulu lwa hinu, na wumi wa magono goha palusenje lwelubwela.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilongela mala ya datu ndava ya kufwa na kuyuka kwaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matei 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maluko 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yesu akavakemela kuchiyepela vawuliwa vaki kumi na vavili, na kuvajovela, “Myuwanila! Tihamba ku Yelusalemu na kila chindu chechiyandikiwi na vamlota va Chapanga ndava ya Mwana wa Mundu yati chihengeka. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Muni alagotolewa kwa vandu vangali kuvya Vayawudi vene yati vakumvevesa na kumliga na kumuhunyila mata. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Vene yati Vakumtova na michapilu na kumkoma, nambu paligono la datu yati iyuka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Nambu vene vagamanyi lepi malovi genago hati padebe, lijambu lenilo lafiyiki kwa vene, ndi vagamanyili lepi geavajovili.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumlamisa ngalola myupaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matei 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maluko 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Lukumbi Yesu peahegalili ku Yeliko, kwavi na mundu mmonga ngalola atamili pamuhana ya njila ayupayi. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Peayuwini msambi wa vandu wipita akakota, “Chivii kyani?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Vakamjovela, “Yesu wa Nazaleti ipita.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Akajova kwa lwami luvaha, “Yesu, wa chiveleku cha Daudi unihengela lipyana!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Vandu vevalongolili vala vakamywangila aguna, nambu mwene akayonjokesa kujova kwa lwami luvaha, “Yesu wa chiveleku cha Daudi, unihengela lipyana!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Yesu akayima, akalagiza vandu vamleta palongolo yaki. Ngalola yula peahikili papipi, Yesu akamkota, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>“Wigana nikukitila kyani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Ngalola akayangula, “Bambu, nihotola kulola kavili.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Yesu akamjovela, “Lola! Kusadika kwaku kukulamisi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Bahapo ngalola yula akalola, akamlanda Yesu kuni akumulumba Chapanga. Vandu voha pavagawene genago, vakamulumba Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Zakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Yesu payingili ku Yeliko, apitayi munjila za muji wenuwo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Pamuji wenuwo pavi mundu mmonga liina laki Zakayo, avi mkulu wa vatola kodi mwenuyo avi na vindu vyamahele. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Mwenuyo aganayi kumlola Yesu ndi yani, nambu ahotwili lepi ndava ya msambi wa vandu, na Zakayo avi mundu mhupi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Hinu, akajumba kulongolo na kukwela mumkongo uvaha ndava amlolayi Yesu, muni Yesu apitayi njila yeniyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Yesu peahikili pandu penapo, akalola kunani na kumjovela Zakayo, “Huluka kanyata, muni lelu yati niwela munyumba yaku.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Penapo Zakayo akahuluka pahi na kumpokalela Yesu kwa luheku. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Vandu voha pevaloli genago, vakatumbula kung'ung'uta na kujova, “Mundu uyu ahambili kutama kwa mundu mweakumbudila Chapanga!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Nambu Zakayo akayima palongolo akamjovela Yesu, “Bambu Yuwanila! Yati nigava pagati vindu vyangu na kuvapela vangangu na ngati natolili chindu cha mundu kwa kuchenjela, yati nimuwuyisila mala mcheche.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yesu akamjovela, “Lelu usangula uyingili munyumba iyi, muni na mwenuyu mewa chiveleku cha Ibulahimu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Muni Mwana wa Mundu abwelili kulonda na kusangula veviyagili.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa Salafu za mashonga kumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matei 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Vandu vavi vakumuyuwanila Yesu peavi papipi kuhika ku Yelusalemu vandu vaholalela Unkosi wa Chapanga uvi papipi kuhumila ndava genago Yesu avajovili luhumu wungi. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Hinu akavajovela, kwavili na mundu mmonga wa lukolo lwa unkosi, mwaahambili kumulima wa kutali muni avikiwa unkosi na nkosi mkulu na kuwuya. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Akavakemela vatumisi vaki kumi, na kuvapela kila mundu mashonga salafu zeziwanangana na luhuna lwa lihengu la mihyei yidatu, kila mmonga na kuvajovela, mhengela lihengu la kugula na kugulisa vindu mbaka peniwuyayi. <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Nambu vandu va mulima wenuwo vamuhakalili mundu mwenuyo, ndi vatumili vajumbi vamulanda na kuhamba kujova, tigani lepi mundu uyu avyaa nkosi witu.<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>“Mundu mwenuyo agotoliwi unkosi wenuwo na kuwuya pamulima waki. Bahapo akalagiza vakemelewayi vavanda vevapewili mashonga vala, muni aganayi kumanya ngati kila mmonga ayonjokisi mashonga galinga. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Akabwela mvanda mtumbula akajova, ‘Bambu, lilundu limonga la mashonga lewanipelili niyonjokisi malundu gangi kumi ga mashonga.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Bambu yula akajova, ‘Chabwina.’ Veve wamtumisi mbwina! Ndava muni usadikiwi mumambu gadebe, ‘Hinu yati nikuvika uvya chilongosi mumiji kumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Akagelekela mtumisi yungi akajova, ‘Bambu lilundu la mashonga yewanipelili niyonjakisi malundu ga mashonga gangi mhanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Bambu yula akamjovela, ‘Na veve yati nikupela uvya wa chilongosi mumiji mhanu.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>“Muhengaji yungi akabwela na kujova, ‘Bambu, tola lishonga laku muni nakungili muchitambala na kuyifiya pabwina. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Ndava muni nakuyogwipi, muni veve wa mundu winonopa. Witola vindu vyangali vyaku nakubena pawangamija.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Bambu yula akamjovela, ‘Yati nikuhamula ndava ya malovi gaku veve mtumisi mhakau! Kumbi wamanyi hotohoto ngati nene ninonopa, ndava nitola vyangali kuvya vyangu na kubena panangamija. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Ndava kyani wavikili lepi malundu ga mashonga gangu mubenki? Na nene nganitolili pamonga na chiyonjakesu peniwuya.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>“Akavajovela vevavi penapo, ‘Mumnyagayi lilundu la lishonga lenilo, mukampela yula mweavi na malundu ga mashonga kumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Vene vakamjovela, ‘Mwenuyo amali kupewa malundu ga mashonga kumi!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>Bambu akavayangula, ‘Nikuvajovela, mundu yoyoha mweavi na chindu yati ipewa na kuyonjokesewa. Nambu mweangali chindu. Hati cheavi nachu yati inyagiwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Na hinu vamakoko vangu vevakunibela nikotoka kuvya nkosi wavi, muvaletayi penapa na muvahinja palongolo yangu!’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu iyingila ku Yelusalemu kwa luheku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matei 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohani 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Yesu peamali kujova genago, akavalongolela kuhamba ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Peavili papipi kuhika ku Betifage na ku Betania papipi na chitumbi cha mikongo ya Mizeituni, avatumili vavili va vawuliwa vaki, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>na kuvajovela, “Muhamba muchijiji chechivii palongolo yinu, na pemwitumbula kuyingila muchijiji chenicho yati mulikolela mapapakasi wa punda akungiwi langatumbula kugega mundu. Muwopolayi, mubwela nalu apa.<figure style="fig" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" ref="19:30">Mpapakasi wa Lipunda</figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Ngati mundu akuvakota, ndava kyani mukuliwopola lipunda? Mumjovela, ‘Bambu akumgana.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Vevatumiwi vala vakahamba nakukolela ngati chavajoviwi na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Pevawopolayi punda mpakakasi, vakolo lipunda vakavakota, “Ndava kyani mukuliwopola lipunda mpapakasi ili?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Vakayangula, “Bambu akumgana.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Ndi vampelakili Yesu. Kangi vakatola nyula na kumuyambatisa punda mpapakasi panani na kumtamisa Yesu panani yaki. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Yesu ayendalili na lugendu kuni vandu vayendelela kumdandasila nyula zavi munjila.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Paavi papipi kuhika ku Yelusalemu paluhelelu lwa chitumbi cha mikongo ya Mizeituni, msambi woha wa vandu na vawuliwa vaki vatumbwili kumlulutila kwa lwami luvaha na kumlumba Chapanga ndava ya mambu gakulu goha gevagaweni, <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>vakajova, “Amotisiwa Nkosi mweibwela kwa uhotola wa Bambu! Uteke uvya kunani kwa Chapanga na Chapanga alumbiwa mweavi kunani!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Vafalisayu vangi vevavili mu msambi wula wa vandu vakamjovela Yesu, “Muwula, vagunisa vawuliwa vaku!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Yesu akavayangula, “Nikuvajovela, ngati venava vaguni, maganga haga yati giywanga.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuuvembela muji wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Paavi papipi neju na kuulola muji wa Yelusalemu, akauvembela muji wenuwo, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>akajova, “Ngati kuvya umanyili lelu mambu gegileta uteke! Nambu hinu gafiyiki pamihu gaku! <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Muni galabwela magono, penapo vamakoko vaku yati vakutindikila luwumba, yati vakuhaka na kukuhinya pandi zoha. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Penapo yati vakutimbisula veve na vana vaku muluwumba wula, vakulekela lepi hati liganga limonga lelisigalila panani ya liganga lingi, ndava wamanyi lepi lukumbi Chapanga peakubweli kukusangula!”<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihamba mu Nyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matei 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maluko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohani 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Kangi Yesu akayingila mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, akutumbula kuvavinga vandu vevagulisa na kugula vindu, <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>akajova, “Yiyandikiwi, ‘Nyumba yangu yati yivya nyumba ya kumyupila Chapanga.’ Nambu nyenye muhiyusi kuvya libokoselu la vanyagaji.”<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Ligono kwa ligono Yesu avawulayi mu Nyumba ya Chapanga. Nambu Vakulu va Kuteta na vawula va malagizu na vachilongosi va vandu, valonda njila ya kumkoma, <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>nambu vavi nakumanya cha kukita ndava vandu voha vagunili kumyuwanila.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Likotesi ndava uhotola wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matei 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maluko 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Ligono limonga, Yesu peavi mukuwula vandu mu Nyumba ya Chapanga na kuvakokosela Lilovi la Bwina, vakulu va kuteta na vawula va malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa na vagogo va Vayawudi, vamhambili. <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>Vakajova, “Utijovelayi! Wikita mambu aga kwa uhotola gani?” Ndi yani mweakupelili uhotola wenuwo?<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Yesu akavajovela, “Na nene yati nikuvakota likotesi, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>wu, uhotola wa Yohani wa kubatiza, wahumili kwa Chapanga amala kwa vandu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Vakakotana vene kwa vene, “Tikajova wahumili kwa Chapanga, yati akutikota, ‘Ndava kyani mwamsadiki lepi?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Nambu tikajova wahumili kwa vandu, vandu voha yati vakutikoma na maganga, muni woha visadika kuvya Yohani avi mlota wa Chapanga.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Vakamyangula, “Timmanyi lepi kwegahumili.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Yesu akavajovela, “Na nene nikuvajovela lepi nikita mambu genago kwa uhotola wa yani.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu lwa mgunda wa mizabibu na valimaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matei 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maluko 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Yesu akayendelela kuvajovela luhumu ulu, “Mundu mmonga alimili mgunda wa mizabibu, avakodishi valimaji, kangi akahamba mulugendu mbaka mulima wa kutali, akatama kwenuko magono gamahele. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Lukumbi lwa kubena mizabibu mundu mwenuyo, amtumili mvanda waki akatola lilundu laki kuhuma ku mgunda. Nambu valimaji wa mumgunda wula vakamtova mvanda yula vakamvinga mawoko gawaka. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Mkolo mgunda amtumili kavili mvanda yungi, nambu vene mewawa vakamtova na kumliga na kumvinga mawoko gawaka. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Kangi akamutuma mvanda wa datu, mwenuyo ndi vakamulemasa na kumtaga kuvala. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Mkolo mgunda yula akahololela, ‘Yati nikita kyani? Yati nikumtuma mwana vangu ngayuyoyo wa chiganu, manya mwenuyo yati vakumtopesa. <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Nambu valimaji vala, pevamuweni, vakajovesana, mwenuyu ndi mhali waki. Hinu timkomayi muni uhali waki uvya witu!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Ndi, vakamuwusa kuvala ya mgunda wula wa mizabibu, vakamukoma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Yesu akavakota, “Mkolo mgunda yula yati akuvakita kyani valimaji vala?”<verse eid="LUK 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>“Yati ibwela kuvakoma valimaji venavo, na kuvapela vangi mgunda wenuwo.” Vandu pevayuwini genago, vakajova, “Lepi! Gakotoka kuhumila hati padebe.”<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Nambu Yesu akavalolokesa na kuvakota. Mayandiku Gamsopi aga mana yaki kyani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">Liganga levabeli vajengaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">hinu ndi liganga likulu la kutumbula pakujenga.<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Mundu yoyoha akagwilila panani ya liganga lenilo yati idenyekana hipandi hipandi, na liganga lenilo lakamgwilila mundu yoyoha ndi likumuyaga nyiminyimi.<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Likotesi ndava ya kumpela kodi Kaisali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matei 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maluko 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Vawula va Malagizu na vakulu va kuteta vamanyili kuvya luhumu lwenuwo ukuvavala vene, ndi vaganayi kumkamula bahapo, nambu vayogwipi vandu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Vamlandili cha papipi. Kangi vakavatuma vamang'omesi, vevajidekisi vandu vabwina muni vamyonja kwa malovi gaki, vakitili genago muni vahotola kumkamula na kumgotola muuhotola wa mkulu wa mkowa. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Vamang'omesi vala vakamjovela, “Muwula timanyili kuvya wijova na wiwula mambu gachakaka, wala nakumlola mundu pamihu ndi wiwula uchakaka munjila ya Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Ndi utijovela, wu! Chabwina amala, lepi tete kulipa kodi kwa nkosi wa ku Loma?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Nambu Yesu amanyili likoka lavi, akavajovela, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>“Munilangisa salafu ya lishonga. Wu, pamihu na liina ndi vya yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Vakamyangula, “Vya nkosi wa ku Loma.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Yesu akavajovela, “Hinu mumpela nkosi wa ku Loma vyaki nkosi wa ku Loma na mumpela Chapanga vyaki Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Vahotwili lepi kumyonjola hati kwa lilovi limonga palongolo ya vandu, vakakangasa kwa mayangula gaki vakaguna.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Likotesi ndava ya kuyuka kwa vevafwili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matei 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maluko 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Kangi Vasadukayu, vevijova kuvya vevafwili viyuka lepi, vakambwelela Yesu, vakajova, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>“Muwula, Musa atiyandikili ngati mlongo mundu afwili na amlekili mdala waki changali vana, yikumgana mhaja waki amhalayi lipwela mwenuyo, muni ambabakisila vana mlongo waki. <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Hinu, kwavili na valongo saba va lukolo lumonga. Mhaja wavi agegili mdala, afwili changaleka mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Mbena waki yula akamhala lipwela, mwene mewa afwili changali mwana, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>hati mbena waki wa datu akamhala, mambu gakavya galagala voha saba vafwili, changali kuvelekisa vana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Pamwishu, mdala yula afwili. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Wu, palukumbi lwa vevafwili kuyukiswa, mdala yula alavya mdala wa yani? Muni agegiwi na voha saba.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yesu akayangula, “Vandu va lusenje lwa hinu vigega na kugegewa, <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Nambu vala vevahaguliwi na veviganikiwa kupewa wumi wa mulima wula, na kuyukiswa kula kuhuma kwa vevafwili, vigega lepi amala kugegewa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Chakaka vifwa lepi kavili ndava viwanangana na vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga, ndi vana vaki Chapanga, ndava ya kuyukiswa kwavi. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Hati, Musa atilangisi njwe, kuvya vevafwili yati viyukiswa, mu Mayandiku Gamsopi. Pamihu ga padahi pepiyaka motu, akumuluwula Bambu Chapanga ngati Chapanga wa Ibulahimu na Chapanga wa Izaki na Chapanga wa Yakobo. <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Mwene, lepi Chapanga wa vevafwili nambu kwa vamumi, ndava muni kwa mwene voha vilama.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Vawula va malagizu vangi va Musa vakajova, “Muwula, uvayangwili hotohoto!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Vandu vala vayogwipi kumkota kavili makotesi gangi.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Likotesi ndava ya chiveleku cha Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matei 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maluko 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Yesu akavakota, vandu vijova wuli, Kilisitu Msangula ndi mwana wa chiveleku cha Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Muni Daudi mwene ajovili muchitabu cha Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Bambu, amjovili Bambu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Tama muchiwoko changu cha kulyela<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>hati nivavika makoko vaku pahi pa magendelu gaku.<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Ngati Daudi akumkemela mwene, Bambu, hinu yihotoleka wuli, kuvya mwana waki?<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvajovela vandu vajiyangalila na vawula va malagizu ga Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matei 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maluko 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Yesu avajovili vawuliwa vaki palongolo ya vandu voha, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>“Mujiyangalila na vawula va Malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa, vevigana kugendagenda kuni vawalili magwanda gatali. Vigana kujambuswa chakufugwamila pandu pakugulisila vindu, kutama muvigoda vya kulongolo mu nyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi, kutama muvigoda vya kulongolo ku mselebuko. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Vinyaga nyumba za vapwela kwa kuchenjela, na viyupa kwa Chapanga lukumbi lutali, muni valolekanayi na vandu kuvya vabwina. Yati vihamuliwa neju kuliku vangi!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Luteta lwa lipwela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maluko 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Yesu pealolokesa takataka, avawene vandu vevana vindu vyamahele chevisopa luteta muchijomela cha Nyumba ya Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Mewa amuwene lipwela mngangu isopa mashonga sendi zivili. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Akajova, “Chakaka nikuvajovela, uyu lipwela mngangu asopili neju kuliku voha. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Muni, vangi voha vasopili luteta, muvindu vyavi vyeviyonjokisi, nambu mau uyu pamonga na ungangu waki asopili chindu cheavi nachu ndava ya wumi waki.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ijova kugwisiwa kwa Nyumba ya Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matei 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maluko 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Vandu vangi valongelelayi malovi ga kuyivala Nyumba ya Chapanga, cheyinyambwisi bwina kwa maganga ga mashonga gamahele, na luteta zezasopiwi kwa Chapanga kangi Yesu akajova. <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>“Goha aga gemkugawona galabwela magono kawaka hati liganga limonga lelisigalila panani ya liganga lingi, kila chindu yati chidenyekana.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ani na mang'ahiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matei 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maluko 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Ndi vakamkota, “Muwula mambu, genago yati gihumila ndali? Hinu ulangisu woki weulangisa papipi pagihumila mambu genago?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yesu akavayangula, “Mujiyangalilayi, mkoto kukongiwa muni vamahele yati vibwela na kulihengela liina langu. Kuni kila mmonga yati ijova kuvya ‘Mwene ndi Kilisitu msangula!’ ‘Lukumbi luhikili!’ Nambu nyenye mkoto kuvalanda. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Hinu, pamwiyuwana malovi ga ngondo na mng'anamukanu nakuyogopa, muni yiganikwa genago gahumila hoti, nambu pamwishu wene wakona.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Kangi akayendelela kujova, “Vandu va mulima umonga yati witovana na vandu va mulima wungi, na unkosi umonga yati utovana na unkosi wungi.” <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Kila pandu yati pivya na mindendemo yivaha ya ndima na njala na matamu ga kukangasa na kuyogofya, na ulangisu ukulu kuhumila kunani kuliundi. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Nambu, kwakona kuhumila genago goha, yati vakuvakamula na vakuvang'aha na kuvapeleka munyumba za kukonganekela Vayawudi na kuvakunga muchifungu, yati vakuvapeleka kwa vankosi na vachilongosi, ndava ya liina langu, <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>muhotola kujova kwa vene. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Mkangamala mumitima yinu, mkoto kuholela kwakona, wuli mukujikengelela, <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Ndava namwene yati nikuvapela malovi ga luhala, hati makoko winu yati nakuhotola kukangamala amala kuvabelela. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Vadadi na Vanyina vinu, valongo na vandu va lukolo lwinu na vankozi vinu, yati vakuvang'anamukila nyenye, vangi pagati yinu yati mwikomiwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Vandu voha yati vakuvahakalila nyenye ndava yangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Nambu, hati luyunju lumonga wa mumitu yinu lwiyaga lepi. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Msindimala, kwa kusindimala kwinu, yati mwisangula wumi winu.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ijova ndava ya kugwiswa kwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matei 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maluko 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>Nambu, “Pemwilola chikundi cha manjolinjoli chiutindili muji wa Yelusalemu, mumanya kuvya lusenje lwa kudenyeka kwaki luhikili. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Hinu, vevavi ku Yudea vajumbalila kuchitumbi na vevavi kumuji vawuka na vevavi kumgunda vala vakotoka kuwuya kumuji. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Ndava magono ago ndi magono ga Chapanga kuvabuna vandu vaki, muni kukita mambu goha gegayandikwi mu Mayandiku Gamsopi gahengeka. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Valachikolela vadala vana ndumbu na vevinyongesa magono genago! Muni yati kwiva na mang'ahiso gamahele mu mulima na ligoga la Chapanga likuvabwelela vandu va mulima wa Vayawudi. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Vangi vikomiwa kwa upanga, vangi vitoliwa na kupechenganwa mumilima yoha, muji wa Yelusalemu yati wilongoswa na vandu vangali Vayawudi, mbaka mwishu wa ulongosi wavi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela kwa Mwana wa Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matei 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maluko 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>“Yati kwivya na ulangisu mulilanga na mwehi na ndondo. Na vandu pamulima yati vivagaya ndava ya wogohi wa kubuma kwa luyuga lwa nyanja. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Vandu yati vihinduka ndava ya wogohi, pevilola mambu gegakuukolela mulima, muni vindu vyoha vya kulihundi lilanga na mwehi na ndondo na vingi vyoha yati vinyugusika. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Kangi, yati vamlola Mwana wa Mundu ibwela mulihundi, ana makakala na ukulu wamahele. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Lukumbi mambu genago pagitumbula kuhumila, myimayi mkangamala, muni kugomboka kwinu kuhegalili.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhumu wa mkongo wa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matei 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maluko 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Kangi akavajovela luhumu, “Mlola mkongo wa mtini na mikongo yingi yoha. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Pemwilola yitumbula kumela mahamba, mwavene mwimanya kuvya lusenje lwa fula luhegelili. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Mewawa, pamwilola mambu genago gihengeka yati mwimanya kuvya Unkosi wa Chapanga uvi papipi.<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Chakaka nikuvajovela, chiveleku ichi cha hinu chipita lepi kwakona genago goha kuhengeka. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Kunani kwa Chapanga na pamulima yati ziwuka, nambu malovi gangu katu gipita lepi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mujiyangalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>“Mujiyangalilayi! Mitima yinu yikotoka kutopelwa, kwa mambu ga kugala na uhutulu na mang'ahiso ga mulima uwu. Muni ligono lenilo likuvabwelela chigafula. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Muni yikuvabwelela ngati likoka vandu voha vevitama pamulima poha. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Hinu muvyamihu, na muyupayi kwa Chapanga lukumbi lwoha muni muhotola mpata makakala ga kuyepa mambu genago goha pegihumila, na kuyima palongolo ya Mwana wa Mundu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Kila ligono muhi magono ago, Yesu avi mukuwula vandu mu Nyumba ya Chapanga, nambu kilu ahambayi kuchitumbi cha mizeituni na kutama kwenuko. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Na vandu voha vayumwiki lukela hambakucha kuhamba pa Nyumba ya Chapanga, vapata kumyuwanila Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Mpangu wa kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matei 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maluko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohani 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Mselebuko wa mabumunda gangali ngemeku, wewikemiwa Pasaka yavi papipi. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Vakulu va kuteta na vawula va malagizu ga Musa vakavya mukulonda njila ya kumkoma Yesu, nambu vavayogwipi vandu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda iyidikila kumng'anamukila Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matei 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maluko 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Setani akamyingila Yuda mweikemelewa Isikalioti, mmonga pagati ya vamitumi vala kumi na vavili. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Yuda akahamba, kulongela na vakulu va kuteta na vakulu va valonda va Nyumba ya Chapanga, ndava ya kuvagotolela Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Vene vakaheka na vakayidakila kumpela mashonga. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Yuda akayidakila, ndi alonda fwasi ya bwina ya kumgotola Yesu changali msambi wa vandu kumanya.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutendelekela chakulya cha Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matei 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maluko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohani 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Ligono la mabumunda gangasopewa ngemeku likahika. Lenilo ndi ligono la kuhinjwa mwana limbelele wa Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Yesu akavatuma Petili na Yohani, avajovili “Mhamba mkatendekelayi chakulya cha Pasaka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Vene vakamkota, “Wigana tikutendelekayi koki?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Yesu akavajovela, “Myuwanila! Pamwiyingila kumuji yati mwikonganeka na mgosi mweagegili chihulu cha manji. Mumlanda mbaka munyumba yeiyingila. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Mumjovela mkolo nyumba, ‘Muwula akukota, chivii koki chumba nilyayi chakulya cha Pasaka pamonga na vawuliwa vangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Hinu mkolo nyumba yati akuvalangisa chumba chivaha cha kugolofa chechivikiwi kila chindu. Hinu mtendelekeha chakulya mwenumo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Vakahamba, vakakolela kila chindu chivili ngati Yesu cheavajovili, ndi vakatendelekela chakulya cha Pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilya chakulya cha Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matei 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maluko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Vakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Lukumbi palwahikili, Yesu akatama kulya chakulya pamonga na vamitumi vaki. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Akavajovela, “Ninogili neju kulya chakulya cha Pasaka yeniyi pamonga na nyenye, kwakona kung'aiswa kwangu. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Muni nikuvajovela, yati nilya lepi kavili Pasaka mbaka penapo payikamilika Muunkosi wa Chapanga.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Kangi Yesu akatola chikombi, akamsengusa Chapanga akajova, “Mtola, mpelanayi mwavoha, <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Muni nikuvajovela, kuhumila hinu ninywa lepi kavili divayi mbaka Unkosi wa Chapanga peubwela.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Mewawa akatola libumunda, akamsengusa Chapanga, akayimetula, akavapela akajova, “Yeniyi ndi higa yangu yemwipewa nyenye. Muni munikumbukayi nene.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Akakita mewawa na chikombi peamali kulya, akajova, “Chikombi ichi ndi lilaganu la mupya yeyilangiswa na ngasi yangu na yeyiyitika ndava yinu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>“Nambu, mlola! Mweakuning'anamukila avi bahapa pachakulya pamonga na nene. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Chakaka Mwana wa Mundu ihamba kukomiwa, ngati cheaganili Chapanga, nambu alachikolela mundu yula mweamng'anamukila.”<verse eid="LUK 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Penapo vakatumbula kukotana vene kwa vene yani pagati yavi mwaihenga lijambu lenili.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mhutanu ndava ya yani mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Vamitumi va Yesu vakatumbula kuhutana kumvala yani mweihololewa kuvya mkulu kuliku vangi. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Yesu akavajovela, “Vankosi va milima vakuvalongosa vandu kwa makakala, na vachilongosi vakujikemela kuvya ‘Vankozi va vandu.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Nambu yikoto kuvya chenichi pagati yinu, mweavimkulu pagati yinu yikumgana kuvya ngati mdebe, na mweavi chilongosi yikumgana kuvya ngati mtumisi. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Muni, ndi yani mweavi mkulu, mweitama pameza kulya chakulya, amala yula mweitumikila? Chakaka ndi yula mweitama pameza kulya chakulya! Pamonga na genago, nambu nene nivii pagati yinu ngati muhengaji.”<verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>“Nyenye ndi mwemwasigalili na nene lukumbi lwoha lwa mang'ahiso gangu, <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>ngati, Dadi cheanigotolili nene uhotola wa kulongosa, mewawa na nene nikuvagotolela nyenye, uhotola wenuwo. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Hinu, yati mwinywa na kulya pameza yangu muunkosi wangu na kutama muvigoda vya Unkosi na kuhamula makabila kumi na gavili ga Isilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilotela ngati Petili yati akumbela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matei 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohani 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>“Yesu akajova, Simoni, Simoni! Yuwanila! Setani ayupili luwusa kwa Chapanga lwa kuvalinga nyenye kulola ngati muyendelela kuvya vamsadika. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Nambu nene nikukuyupila veve muni kusadika kwaku kukotoka kupungula. Na veve peukuvawuyila vakangamalisa valongo vaku.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Ndi Petili akayangula, “Bambu, nene nijitendelekili kuhamba na veve muchifungu amala kufwa pamonga na veve.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Nambu Yesu akajova, “Nikukujovela Petili, kwakona lijogolo langavika lelu yati ukunibela mala zidatu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chihaku cha mashonga na lihaku na upanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Kangi, Yesu akavakota vawuliwa vaki, “Panakavatumili changali chihaku cha mashonga amala lihaku amala champali za munjila mwapungukiwi na chindu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Vakamyangula, “Lepi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Yesu akavajovela, “Nambu hinu mundu mweavi na chihaku cha mashonga agega na mweavi na lihaku mewawa. Na yoyoha angali upanga agulisa likoti laki na akagula umonga. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Yiyandikwi mu Mayandiku Gamsopi, ‘Avalangiwi kuvya mmonga pagati ya vandu vanyagaji,’ Nikuvajovela naha, Mayandiku giganikiwa gatimila ndava yangu, ndava muni wumi wangu wihika pamwishu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Vawuliwa vakajova, “Bambu, lola, penapa zivii panga zivili.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Akavajovela, “Tigaleki!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuyupa Chapanga ku Chitumbi cha Mizeituni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matei 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maluko 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Yesu akawuka ngati chayavili mvelu waki, akahamba kuchitumbi cha Mizeituni vawuliwa vaki vakamlanda. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Pehahikili pandu pala akavajovela vawuliwa vaki, “Muyupayi, mukoto kuyingila mukulingiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Kangi mwene akavaleka, akahamba utali wa mundu kujugumila liganga, akafugama, akayupa. <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>Akajova, “Dadi, ngati wigana uniwusila chikombi ichi cha mang'ahiso, nambu lepi chiganu changu, ndi chewigana wamwene.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Kangi, Mtumu wa kunani kwa Chapanga akahumila akamkangamalisa. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Hinu peavi mulipyanda, akamuyupa Chapanga neju, na lihuki ngati matonji ga ngasi, gamhulwili pahi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Peamali kuyupa, akayima kuvawuyila vawuliwa vaki akavakolela vagonili, ndava vavi ngolongondi. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Yesu akavajovela, “Ndava kyani mwigona? Muyumuka muyupa, mkoto kuyingila mukulingiwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kukamuliwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matei 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yohani 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Peavi akona ilongela, msambi wa vandu ukabwela kuni ulongoswa na Yuda mmonga wa vawuliwa kumi na vavili. Yuda akamhegelela Yesu na kumjambusa cha kumkumbatila. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Nambu Yesu akamjovela, “Yuda! Wu, ukumng'anamukila Mwana wa Mundu kwa jambusa ya kumkumbatila?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Vawuliwa vala pavachiwene chechihumila vakakota, “Bambu, tivadumula na panga zitu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Ndi mmonga pagati yavi akamtova mvanda wa Mteta Mkulu wa Chapanga, akamdumula likutu la upandi wa kulyela.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Nambu Yesu akajova, “Mleka! Yikoli.” Akampamisa likutu la mundu yula, akamlamisa.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Kangi Yesu akavajovela, vakulu va vakulu va kuteta na vakulu va valonda va Nyumba ya Chapanga na vagogo vevabweli kumkamula, “Wu, mbweli na mapanga na vibonga kunikamula ngati nene namnyagaji? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Penavi pamonga na nyenye magono goha Munyumba ya Chapanga mwanikamwili lepi. Nambu ulu ndi lukumbi lwinu, lukumbi lwa uchilongosi wa chitita.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petili akumbela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matei 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maluko 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohani 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Vakamkamula Yesu, na kumtola, kuhamba nayu kunyumba ya Mteta Mkulu wa Chapanga. Petili amlandili cha kutali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Vakakosa motu pagati ya luvanja lwa nyumba vakatama pamonga, na Petili avili pagati yavi. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Muhengaji mmonga mdala peamuwene Petili atamili papipi na motu, akamlolokesa akajova, “Mundu uyu mewawa avi pamonga na Yesu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Nambu petili akabela akajova, “Mdala veve! Nene nimmanyili lepi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Mwanakandahi, mundu yungi amuweni Petili, akajova “Veve wa mmonga wavi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Nambu Petili akayangula “Bambu veve, lepi nene!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Ngati lukumbi lwa saa yimonga palongolo, mundu yungi akajova, “Chakaka na mundu uyu avi pamonga na Yesu, ndava mwenuyu mewa Mgalilaya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Nambu Petili akajova, “Bambu veve, nichimanyili lepi chewijova!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Bahapo peavi akona ilongela lijogolo likavika. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Bambu akamng'anamuka na kumlola Petili, ndi Petili agakumbwiki geajoviwi na Bambu gala, “Lelu kilu kwakona lijogolo kuvika yati ukunibela mala yidatu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Penapo Petili akahuma kuvala akavemba neju.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumvevesa na kumtova Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matei 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maluko 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Vandu vevamyangalila Yesu vala, vakamtova na kumvevesa. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Vakamgubika mihu na chitambala, vakavya kumkota, lotelayi yani mwaakutovili? <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Vakamjovela malovi ga mahele ga maligu.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumpeleka pa libanji likulu la Chiyawudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matei 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maluko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohani 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Kwapachili, vagogo va mulima na vakulu va kuteta na vawula va malagizu ga Musa, vakonganiki pamonga, vakamtola Yesu vakampeleka mulibanji lavi likulu la Vayawudi. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Vene vakamjovela “Utijovela! Wu, veve ndi Kilisitu Msangula?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Nambu Yesu akayangula, “Hati ngati nivajovili, yati mwisadika lepi, <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>Na ngati nivakotili nyenye, yati nakuniyangula. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Nambu kutumbula hinu, Mwana wa Mundu yati itama upandi wa kulyela wa Chapanga ana makakala.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Voha vakamkota, “Ndi, veve Mwana wa Chapanga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Mwene akayangula, “Mwavene ndi mujovili kuvya ndi nene.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Kangi vakajova, “Hinu, tigana lepi ujova wungi ndava yaki? Tavete timyuwini cheijova mumlomo waki mwene.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ipelekwa palongolo ya Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matei 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maluko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohani 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Msambi wa vandu voha vevakonganiki pala, vakayima na kumpeleka Yesu palongolo ya Pilatu, <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Vakatumbula kumtakila vakajova, “Tamkolili mundu uyu avayaganisa vandu vitu na kavili akuvabesa vandu vakotoka kumpela kodi nkosi wa ku Loma na kujikemela ati mwene ndi Kilisitu Msangula Nkosi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Pilatu akamkota Yesu, “Veve ndi Nkosi wa Vayawudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu akamyangula, “Veve wamwene ndi ujovili, veve Nkosi wa Vayawudi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Pilatu akavajovela vakulu va kuteta na msambi wa vandu, “Nakuchiwona chindu cheabudili mundu uyu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Nambu vene vakajova chinganga, “Akuvakulukisa vandu kwa mawuliwu gaki mumulima woha wa Yudea, atumbwili ku Galilaya na hinu avi penapa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumpeleka kwa Helodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Pilatu peayuwini genago, akakota, “Wu, mundu uyu ndi mkolonjinji wa ku Galilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Peamanyili Yesu ihuma mumulima wewilongoswa na Helodi, ndi ampeliki kwa Helodi muni lukumbi lwenulo mewa avi ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Helodi akavya na luheku neju peamuweni Yesu. Muni amali kuyuwana mambu ga Yesu, ndi magono gamahele anogelayi kumlola Yesu cheikita gachinamtiti. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Helodi amkotili Yesu makotesi gamahele, nambu Yesu nakumyangula chindu. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Vakulu va kuteta na vawula va malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa vakayima kulongolo na kumtakila chinganganga. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Helodi pamonga na vamanjolinjoli vaki vakampeli soni Yesu na kumvevesa, kangi vakamuwalika ligwanda la unkosi na kumuwuyisa kwa Pilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Magono gamumbele Helodi na Pilatu vatamanila cha umakoko, nambu kutumbula ligono lenilo vakavya vankozi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihamuliwa lifwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matei 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maluko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohani 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Pilatu akavakemele pamonga, Vamteta vakulu na vachilongosi va Chiyawudi na vandu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>akavajovela, “Mumletili mundu uyu mwijova akuvayaganisa vandu. Hinu myuwanila! Nimali kulola muhalu uwu palongolo yinu kawaka chindu cheabudili mu mambu goha gemumtakili. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Lepi nene ndu, nambu hati Helodi mewa, amuwuyisi kavili, ndava kawaka chindu cheabudili cheachiwene, kwa mundu uyu hati ahamuliwa lifwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Yati nilagazila atovewa michapilu ya miinga, na kumulekekesa. <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Mselebuko wa Pasaka, Pilatu yamganili kuvadindulila mundu mmonga kuhuma muchifungu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Nambu voha vakaywanga, “Mkoma mundu uyu! Utidindulilayi Balaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Balaba asopiwi muchifungu ndava ya kukulukisa vandu muchitutu na muchitutu chenicho mundu mmonga akomiwi.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Pilatu aganili kumulekekesa Yesu, ndi akalongela nawu kavili vandu vevamtakili Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Nambu vene vakaywanga vakajova, “Mvambayi pamsalaba, mvambayi pamsalaba!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Pilatu akavajovela mala ya datu, “Chindu gani cheabudili mundu uyu? Nichiwona lepi chindu cheabudili hati ahamuliwa kukomiwa! Nene yati nilagiza atovewayi michapilu na kumlekekesa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Nambu vene vakayonjokesa kuywanga neju, Yesu yiganikwa avambiwayi pamsalaba, lwami zavi pamwishu zayuwaniki. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Hinu, Pilatu akahamula gahengeka. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Akamulekekesa kuhuma muchifungu yula mweakukingiwi ndava ya kuvya pamonga na vandu muchitutu na kukoma mundu mmonga, ndi akamgotola Yesu vamukita ngati chevigana.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vakumvamba pamsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matei 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohani 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Pevavi mukupeleka, vakakonganeka na mundu mmonga liina laki Simoni mkolonjinji wa Kulene, mweahumayi kumgunda waki, ndi vakamkamula na kumgegesa msalaba wula mumbele ya Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Vandu msambi kwa msambi, wamulandili, pagati yavi vavi vadala vevamuvembelayi Yesu ndava ya lipyanda. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Yesu akavang'anamukila, akajova, “Vamawu va Yelusalemu! Mkoto kunivembela nene, nambu mujivembela mwavene na vana vinu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Muni chakaka walabwela lukumbi, yati mwijova, ‘Mbanga yavi vadala, vangali vana na vangavaleke, amala vanganyong'esa vana!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Lukumbi lwenulo, yati vandu vakuvijovela vidunda, mutigwilila na tudunda, ‘Mutigubika!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Ngati vandu vakunikitila nene chenicho mwenivili ngati mkongo uvisi, yati yivya wuli kwa nyenye mwemuvi ngati mkongo uyumu?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Mewa vavatoli vandu vangi vavili vanyagaji vavapeliki, kukomiwa pamonga na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Pavahikili pandu pepikemelawa, “Libangu la Mutu,” Ndi vakamvamba Yesu pamsalaba pamonga na vanyagaji vavili vala mmonga upandi waki wa kulyela na yungi upandi wa kumangeya. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yesu akajova, “Dadi, valekekesa, muni nakumanya chevikita.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Kangi, vakagavana nyula zaki kwa kuhagula kwa gudugudu. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Vandu vayimili kulolokesa kuni vakulu va Vayawudi chevamvevisi vijova, “Avasangwili vangi, hinu ajisangula mwene ngati mwene ndi Kilisitu mwehaguliwi na Chapanga!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Manjolinjoli mewa vamvevisi, vamhambili Yesu na kumpela divayi yivavanu, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>Vakumjovela, “Ngati chakaka veve ndi Nkosi wa Vayawudi, ujisangula wamwene!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Panani ya msalaba vavikili chibawu chechayandikiwi, “Mwenuyu ndi Nkosi wa Vayawudi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Mmonga wa vanyagaji vala vevavambiwi pamsalaba akamliga Yesu, akajova “Wu, lepi chakaka kuvya veve ndi Kilisitu Msangula? Jisangula wamwene, utisangula na tete!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Nambu mnyagaji yungi yula, akamuywangila muyaki akamjovela, “Veve ukumuyogopa lepi Chapanga hati padebe? Veve uhamuliwi mewawa. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Veve na nene yikutigana tihamuliwa ndava ya kunyaga kwitu. Nambu mundu uyu kawaka hati chimonga cheabudili.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Kangi akamjovela Yesu, “Veve Yesu! Ukoto kunikosiwa peuyingila Munkosi waku!”<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yesu akamyangula, “Chakaka nikujovela lelu yati tivya na nene kupaladiso.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ifwa pamsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matei 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohani 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Kutumbula saa sita muhi, chitita chikagubika mulima woha mbaka saa tisa, <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>na lilanga likakotoka kulangasa na lipazia lelakovikwi mu Nyumba ya Chapanga likapapuka vipandi vivili. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Yesu akavemba kwa lwami luvaha, “Dadi! Mumawoko gaku nigotola mpungu wangu!” Akadumuka mpungu.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Mkulu wa manjolinjoli yula peagawene gegahumalili, akamulumba Chapanga akajova, “Chakaka mundu uyu avi mbwina!”<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Na vandu voha vevakonganiki penapo ndava ya lijambu lenilo pavagawene gegahumalili gala, vakawuya kunyumba zavi, kuni vakujitova nganga cha ngolongondi. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Vankozi vaki voha pamonga na vadala vealongosini nawu kuhuma ku Galilaya, vayimili cha kutali kulola mambu genago.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Higa ya Yesu vakuyivika mulitinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matei 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohani 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Kwavi na mundu mmonga liina laki Yosefu, avi mmonga wa vachilongosi wa libanji likulu la Vayawudi. Avi mundu mbwina na kukita geigana Chapanga, <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>mwene nakuyidakilana gevapangili na kugakita vachilongosi vayaki va libanji likulu la Vayawudi. Yosefu avi mkolonjinji wa Alimatei, ndi avi mukulindila kubwela kwa Unkosi wa Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Mundu mwenuyo akahamba kwa Pilatu kumuyupa atola higa ya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Akayihulusa higa kuhuma pamsalaba, akayitindisila nyula ya msopi na kuvika mulitinda lelahongoliwi pamhana ya litalau, lavi langavikiwa mundu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Lavi ligono la kutendelekeha, Ligono la Kupumulila ndi latumbukana.<verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Vadala vevalongosini na Yesu kuhuma ku Galilaya vakamulanda Yosefu na kuliwona litinda na higa ya Yesu cheuvikiwi. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Kangi vakawuya kunyumba, vakatendelekela mahuta geginungalila bwina ga kunyala higa ya Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Ligono la Kupumulila vapumulili ngati malagizu ga Chapanga geampeli Musa chegilagiza.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matei 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maluko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohani 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Ligono la Dominika, lukela hamba kucha, vadala vala vakahamba kulitinda, kuni vagegi mayewani na mahuta gakunungalila gevatendekili. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Vakoli liganga lila libilindwisi patali kuhuma pakuyingila mulitinda.<figure style="fig" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" ref="24:2">Liganga libilindwisi patali na litinda</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Hinu, pavayingili mugati, vayiwene lepi higa ya Bambu Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Pevavi vakona vikangasa ndava ya lijambu lenilo, bahapo vandu vavili vevawalili nyula za kung'asima neju vakahumila papipi yavi. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Vadala vala vakavya na wogohi, vakagundama pahi. Ndi vandu vala vakavajovela, “Ndava kyani mukumlonda mundu mweavi mumi pagati ya vevafwili? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Avi lepi apa, ayukili. Muholalela cheavajovili peavi akona ku Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>‘Yikumgana Mwana wa Mundu awusiwayi pavandu vevakumbudila Chapanga, na vene yati vakumvamba pamsalaba na pa ligono la datu yati iyuka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Penapo vadala vala vakagakumbuka malovi ga Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>vakawuya kuhuma kulitinda, vakavajovela vamitumi kumi na mmonga, pamonga na vangi voha, malovi ga mambu ago goha. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Vadala vevabweli kujova mambu genago vavi Maliya mkolonjinji wa Magidala na Yoana na Maliya nyina waki Yakobo pamonga na vadala vangi vevalongosini nawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Nambu vamitumi vala vasadiki lepi malovi ga vadala vala, ndava vagahololela ngati uyimu nunuyu. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Nambu Petili, akajumba kuhamba kulitinda, peahikili kulitinda agundimi kulingulila mugati akayiwona ngayene nyula ya msopi. Akawuya kunyumba kuni ikangasa na kujikota gala gegahumili.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahumila vamulanda vavili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maluko 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Ligono lilolo, vavili pagati ya vamulanda va Yesu vavi mulugendu kuhamba kuchijiji chimonga cha ku Emau chechavi utali wa masaa gavili kuhuma ku Yelusalemu, <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Vavi mukugalongalela mambu goha gegahumalili. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Pavayendelela na malongesi gavi, Yesu mwene akavahumila na kugenda nawu, <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Vamuweni kwa mihu gavi, nambu vadindiwi vakotoka kummanya. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Yesu akavakota, “Mwilongela kyani kuni mwigenda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Vene vakayima pamihu pavi pakwinyini cha ligoga. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Mmonga wavi liina laki Kileopa, akamyangula, “Wu nga veve myehe wangamanya mambu gegahumalili pa Yelusalemu magono gagaga?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Yesu akavakota, “Mambu goki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Vena vakamuyagula, “Mambu gegamkolili Yesu wa ku Nazaleti.” Mwene avi Mlota mweihotola kuhenga na kuwula palongolo ya vandu voha va Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Vakulu va kuteta na vachilongosi vitu vakamgotola na kumuhamula lifwa, vakamvamba pamsalaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Nambu tete tamsadiki mwene kuvya ndi mweatumwili kuyigombola Isilaeli! Hinu, lelu ndi ligono la datu pagahengiki mambu genago. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Kavili vadala vangi va kwitu vatikenyemwisi, muni vakahambili kulitinda lukela hambakucha, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>Nambu nakuyikolela higa ya Yesu. Vakawuya nakutijovela vahumiwi na vamitumu va kunani kwa Chapanga, vevavajovili ngati Yesu akona mumi. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Vayitu vangi pagati yitu vahambili kulitinda kulola gegajoviwi na vadala vala, nambu nakuyiwona lepi mwene.<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Kangi Yesu akavajovela, “Nyenye vayimu na mitima yinu yitopa kusadika gegajoviwi na vamlota va Chapanga! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Wuli, yamganili lepi Kilisitu msangula kung'ahika, kangi ayingilayi muukulu waki?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Hinu akavadandaulila mambu goha gegamuvala mwene mu Mayandiku Gamsopi kutumbula muhitabu ya Musa mbaka muhitabu ya Vamlota va Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Pevahegalili na chijiji chevaambayi, Yesu akakita ngati mweiyendelela na lugendu, <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Nambu vene vakamjovela, chondi pepayi, “Utamayi pamonga na tete, muni lilanga litipimi chitita chibwela.” Ndi akayingila nawu mugati. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Peatamili kulya chakuyla pamonga nawu, akalitola libumunda na kumsengusa Chapanga na kulimetula na kuvapela. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Bahapo vakagubukuliwa mihu gavi na kummanya, nambu mwene akayaga pagati yavi. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Ndi Vakajovesana, “Mitima yitu yasangalwiki neju mugati mwitu peakatidandauli Mayandiku Gamsopi munjila mula?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Balapala vakawuka, kuwuya ku Yelusalemu. Kwenuko vakavakolela vamitumi kumi na mmonga na vangi vevavi pamonga na vene vakonganiki, <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>vakajova, “Chakaka Bambu ayukili! Amuhumalili Simoni!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Hinu vamulanda vavili va Yesu vakavajovela mambu gegavakolili munjila na chevammanyili Yesu pealimetulayi libumunda.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahumila vawuliwa vaki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matei 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohani 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Matendu 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Pevavi mukujovewa genago, Yesu mwene bahapo akayima pagati yavi nakujova, “Uteke uvyayi na nyenye.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Vakakenyemuka na kuyogopa neju muni vaholalelayi pangi valiwene lihoka. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Nambu mwene akavajovela, “Ndava kyani mwivagaya? Ndava kyani mwikujikota kota mumitima yinu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Mlola mawoko na magendelu, muni mumanyayi kuvya ndi nene. Munipamisa mumanya, muni lihoka langali higa amala lijege ngati chemukunilola.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Peamali kujova genago, akavalangisa mawoko na magendelu. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Pevavi vakona kusadika, ndava ya luheku uvaha na kukangasa, Yesu akavakota, “Muvinachu chakulya chochoha penapa?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Vakampela chipandi cha somba yiyochanu, <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>akachitola na kulya kuni woha vakumlola.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Kangi akavajovela, “Genaga ndi malovi genavajovili penakavili na nyenye, muni yaganikwi gahengekayi goha gegayandikiwi kunivala nene mu malagizu ga Musa na muvitabu vya vamlota va Chapanga na Muchitabu cha Zabuli.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Kangi, penapo akavalangasila luhala lwavi muni vagamanyayi Mayandiku Gamsopi. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Akavajovela, “Gayandikiwi kuvya, Kilisitu msangula yati ing'ahiswa nambu paligono la datu yati iyuka kuhuma pavafwili, <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>yikuvagana mewa vandu va makabila goha, kutumbula ku Yelusalemu vakokoselewayi muliina laki kuleka kumbudila Chapanga. Muni valekekeswa kubuda kwavi. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Nyenye ndi mwemugawene mambu genago. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Namwene yati nikuvapelekela yula mweavalagazili Dadi wangu, nambu mulindila kumuji mbaka pemumemeswa uhotola kuhuma kunani.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ikwela kuhamba Kunani kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maluko 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Matendu 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Kangi Yesu akavalongosa vawuliwa kuvala ya muji wenuwo mbaka ku Betania, akayinula mawoko gaki kunani akavamotisa. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Peamali kuvamotisa, akavaleka, akatoliwa kuhamba kunani kwa Chapanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Vawuliwa vakamfugamila Yesu, kangi vakawuya pa Yelusalemu, kuni vavi na luheku luvaha, <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Vayendalili kuvya Panyumba ya Chapanga magono goha, vakumulumbalila Chapanga.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
